1
00:00:05,005 --> 00:00:06,506
[pressure hissing]

2
00:00:11,678 --> 00:00:13,639
[ZZONE] Darn it, I'll get you,
no matter what.

3
00:00:13,722 --> 00:00:15,140
I wonder where he's hiding.

4
00:00:16,767 --> 00:00:19,811
TIME UNTIL ISOLATION IS LIFTED

5
00:00:19,895 --> 00:00:22,981
[ZZONE] I got tagged by Sanghyun
and became a White Card player.

6
00:00:24,233 --> 00:00:25,901
-[host] Tag confirmed.
-Hey!

7
00:00:25,984 --> 00:00:27,569
ZZONE WAS TRICKED AND TAGGED BY SANGHYUN

8
00:00:27,653 --> 00:00:29,363
-That's so annoying.
-[laughing]

9
00:00:29,947 --> 00:00:31,698
[groans] I'm really upset.

10
00:00:31,782 --> 00:00:34,409
It felt like I was given
a ticking time bomb for five minutes.

11
00:00:34,493 --> 00:00:37,037
If I didn't pass it to someone else,

12
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:39,665
I'd be stuck in isolation
and at minus 10 points.

13
00:00:39,748 --> 00:00:42,501
I was tagged
and had failed to survive at this stage.

14
00:00:42,584 --> 00:00:45,879
So I made up my mind
to track him down, no matter what.

15
00:00:46,713 --> 00:00:49,758
TIME UNTIL ISOLATION IS LIFTED

16
00:00:50,342 --> 00:00:52,261
[host] ZZONE's two-minute isolation
has ended.

17
00:00:52,344 --> 00:00:53,345
ZZONE STARTS TO MOVE

18
00:00:56,473 --> 00:01:01,770
WHITE CARD PLAYER IS BACK IN GAME

19
00:01:01,853 --> 00:01:03,814
[Dail] White Card players
are the most dangerous.

20
00:01:04,481 --> 00:01:06,358
She's coming up as a White Card.

21
00:01:06,441 --> 00:01:08,485
White Card players have nothing to lose.

22
00:01:08,569 --> 00:01:10,571
What? [exclaims]

23
00:01:10,654 --> 00:01:12,114
[softly] The Black Card was used?

24
00:01:12,197 --> 00:01:13,240
The Black Card?

25
00:01:14,950 --> 00:01:17,661
[Joonsu] I just started running,
because I had a bad feeling.

26
00:01:18,912 --> 00:01:21,164
[Sanghyun] As the Black and White Cards
appeared at the same time,

27
00:01:21,248 --> 00:01:23,667
I stopped caring about tagging people.

28
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:25,752
[♪ tense music playing]

29
00:01:34,845 --> 00:01:37,472
[dealer] Kim Ddolddol,
please submit your card.

30
00:01:37,556 --> 00:01:39,558
[♪ powerful rock music playing]

31
00:01:40,684 --> 00:01:43,020
You've submitted the Black Card.

32
00:01:44,646 --> 00:01:48,650
The Black Card
is an invincible, ultra-powerful weapon.

33
00:01:48,734 --> 00:01:51,653
And I found it so early in the game.

34
00:01:52,279 --> 00:01:53,864
5 MINUTES AGO

35
00:01:53,947 --> 00:01:56,533
I was searching around the third floor.

36
00:01:58,744 --> 00:02:01,872
And my goodness, there was a safe
on the right as soon as I walked in.

37
00:02:01,955 --> 00:02:03,582
It looked so suspicious.

38
00:02:03,665 --> 00:02:04,708
[exhales] Hang on.

39
00:02:06,543 --> 00:02:10,839
So I looked, and right on top
was some number puzzle

40
00:02:10,922 --> 00:02:12,758
where you had to guess
a four-digit combination.

41
00:02:12,841 --> 00:02:14,259
ANOTHER PUZZLE FOUND BY KIM DDOLDDOL

42
00:02:14,843 --> 00:02:18,096
[softly] That's 40, 50, 40...

43
00:02:18,180 --> 00:02:21,016
So, I quietly worked on it by myself.

44
00:02:21,099 --> 00:02:22,559
[beeps]

45
00:02:28,982 --> 00:02:30,484
[beeping]

46
00:02:32,653 --> 00:02:35,072
But it was so hard
that I just couldn't solve it.

47
00:02:35,155 --> 00:02:36,156
FIRST ATTEMPT FAILED

48
00:02:44,748 --> 00:02:46,917
But when I got a grip and looked again...

49
00:02:47,417 --> 00:02:49,836
I looked closely and all the numbers
were multiples of 10.

50
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:52,005
The 50, 100, and 500 stood out.

51
00:02:52,089 --> 00:02:54,758
I thought, "Were these numbers
combinations of coin values?"

52
00:02:57,552 --> 00:02:59,554
[beeping]

53
00:03:00,180 --> 00:03:03,642
[whispering] Shit. What the hell? Fuck.

54
00:03:03,725 --> 00:03:06,144
The 50 was 50 won,
60 was 50 won plus 10 won.

55
00:03:06,228 --> 00:03:08,271
The numbers were made up of coins.

56
00:03:09,981 --> 00:03:11,650
ASCENDING ORDER OF NUMBERS MADE WITH COINS

57
00:03:12,484 --> 00:03:14,778
It was 10 times 160, so 1,600.

58
00:03:15,737 --> 00:03:16,738
BLACK CARD

59
00:03:16,822 --> 00:03:20,033
I popped it open,
and my goodness, it was a Black Card.

60
00:03:20,117 --> 00:03:22,077
[exclaims] It was absolutely thrilling.

61
00:03:23,870 --> 00:03:25,914
[softly] It's locked.

62
00:03:25,997 --> 00:03:27,374
[beeping]

63
00:03:27,457 --> 00:03:29,459
Okay, no one will solve that.

64
00:03:31,378 --> 00:03:33,213
You can only use it for five minutes.

65
00:03:33,839 --> 00:03:35,298
KIM DDOLDDOL'S BLACK CARD

66
00:03:35,382 --> 00:03:37,551
So I headed out right away to tag someone.

67
00:03:40,345 --> 00:03:41,972
BLACK KIM DDOLDDOL

68
00:03:42,055 --> 00:03:44,433
WHITE ZZONE

69
00:03:46,893 --> 00:03:48,019
[sighs in frustration]

70
00:03:48,103 --> 00:03:52,107
WHITE AND BLACK CARDS
WERE RELEASED AT THE SAME TIME

71
00:03:53,275 --> 00:03:55,193
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

72
00:03:55,694 --> 00:03:57,737
I wanted to tag at least two people.

73
00:04:02,909 --> 00:04:04,995
But there was a problem.

74
00:04:05,078 --> 00:04:07,581
I looked everywhere,
but I couldn't find anyone.

75
00:04:08,206 --> 00:04:10,208
[♪ comical music playing]

76
00:04:10,917 --> 00:04:12,085
No one's hiding here.

77
00:04:12,878 --> 00:04:17,757
KIM DDOLDDOL'S BLACK CARD

78
00:04:20,969 --> 00:04:22,929
So I immediately let my teammates know.

79
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:25,849
I USED THE BLACK CARD
I CAN TAG ANYONE FOR 5 MINUTES

80
00:04:25,932 --> 00:04:27,684
BUT I CAN'T FIND ANYONE

81
00:04:27,768 --> 00:04:30,312
SANGHYUN
JOONSU'S IN COFFIN NEXT TO 3F DEALER ROOM

82
00:04:30,896 --> 00:04:33,607
UPON HEARING BLACK AND WHITE CARDS
HAVE BEEN RELEASED

83
00:04:34,357 --> 00:04:38,195
JOONSU TRIES HIDING IN THE COFFIN

84
00:04:39,279 --> 00:04:41,364
BUT SANGHYUN WAS WATCHING

85
00:04:45,702 --> 00:04:46,953
[chuckling]

86
00:04:47,037 --> 00:04:49,372
Hey, Joonsu. [laughs]

87
00:04:49,456 --> 00:04:51,124
Joonsu, come on out.

88
00:04:51,208 --> 00:04:52,334
Joonsu?

89
00:04:52,417 --> 00:04:53,835
[♪ comical music plays]

90
00:04:54,711 --> 00:04:55,879
[sighing grimly]

91
00:04:57,464 --> 00:04:58,673
[playfully] Hey, Joonsu.

92
00:04:59,716 --> 00:05:01,051
-Come here.
-[Joonsu] I give up.

93
00:05:01,134 --> 00:05:03,178
-I give up. Tag me.
-All right, come here. Okay.

94
00:05:03,261 --> 00:05:04,721
[host] Tag confirmed.

95
00:05:04,805 --> 00:05:05,889
KIM DDOLDDOL TAGS LEE JOONSU

96
00:05:05,972 --> 00:05:08,642
I said, "Joonsu, come on out,"
and tagged him right away.

97
00:05:08,725 --> 00:05:11,728
LEE JOONSU, KIM DDOLDDOL

98
00:05:11,812 --> 00:05:13,647
There wasn't much time left at that point.

99
00:05:13,730 --> 00:05:15,065
Our teamwork was so perfect.

100
00:05:15,148 --> 00:05:16,942
I think I made a pretty good decision.

101
00:05:17,025 --> 00:05:18,026
-[Junseo] From yellow?
-Mix the yellow.

102
00:05:18,109 --> 00:05:19,110
LOOKING FOR NEXT TARGET

103
00:05:19,194 --> 00:05:20,946
Let's change it to orange
and get Horseking.

104
00:05:22,572 --> 00:05:23,573
ALLIANCE STRATEGY GOING SMOOTHLY

105
00:05:23,657 --> 00:05:24,950
[Joonsu] Are you all working together?

106
00:05:25,033 --> 00:05:26,993
We don't know what's down there.

107
00:05:28,328 --> 00:05:29,830
[Ddolddol] I just used
the Black Card but...

108
00:05:29,913 --> 00:05:30,956
-Joonsu...
-[gasps]

109
00:05:31,456 --> 00:05:32,541
[host] Tag confirmed.

110
00:05:32,624 --> 00:05:34,000
ZZONE TAGS SANGHYUN

111
00:05:34,084 --> 00:05:35,752
-Hey.
-What was your color?

112
00:05:35,836 --> 00:05:36,837
-I'm white.
-She's white.

113
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,296
-Gosh. No way.
-Hey.

114
00:05:38,380 --> 00:05:41,216
YOUN SANGHYUN

115
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,426
She just tagged him from behind.

116
00:05:43,510 --> 00:05:44,511
[ZZONE] I nailed my plan.

117
00:05:44,594 --> 00:05:45,595
ZZONE

118
00:05:46,221 --> 00:05:47,514
3 MINUTES AGO

119
00:05:47,597 --> 00:05:50,141
I was looking for Sanghyun
to get my revenge,

120
00:05:52,018 --> 00:05:53,728
and then I heard someone talking.

121
00:05:53,812 --> 00:05:54,980
Do you have red?

122
00:05:55,063 --> 00:05:56,690
-Then, with red...
-[Junseo] Yeah, I'm...

123
00:05:57,399 --> 00:05:59,818
QUIETLY

124
00:06:00,402 --> 00:06:01,820
We don't know what's down there.

125
00:06:01,903 --> 00:06:03,238
[Ddolddol] I just used
the Black Card but...

126
00:06:03,321 --> 00:06:04,322
[gasps]

127
00:06:04,406 --> 00:06:06,825
I tagged him right away
and got my revenge.

128
00:06:06,908 --> 00:06:09,953
I knew I had to run away
from a White Card player,

129
00:06:10,036 --> 00:06:12,038
but I really let my guard down this time.

130
00:06:12,122 --> 00:06:14,457
[groaning] This game's all about time,

131
00:06:15,417 --> 00:06:16,626
but ZZONE got me.

132
00:06:16,710 --> 00:06:19,671
BLACK AND WHITE CARD VICTIMS
LEE JOONSU, YOUN SANGHYUN

133
00:06:22,632 --> 00:06:24,593
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

134
00:06:27,095 --> 00:06:28,179
JOONSU STARTS TO MOVE

135
00:06:28,263 --> 00:06:29,389
[sighs]

136
00:06:30,056 --> 00:06:31,433
[Joonsu] I need to just tag someone.

137
00:06:32,809 --> 00:06:33,894
SANGHYUN STARTS TO MOVE

138
00:06:33,977 --> 00:06:35,186
[Sanghyun sighs] I need to tag someone.

139
00:06:40,233 --> 00:06:43,320
WHITE CARD SANGHYUN IS BACK IN THE GAME

140
00:06:43,403 --> 00:06:46,573
WHITE CARDS SANGHYUN AND JOONSU
ARE BACK IN THE GAME

141
00:06:48,241 --> 00:06:49,492
[Joonsu in English] Fuck.

142
00:06:51,703 --> 00:06:53,330
[in Korean] Where are they?

143
00:06:55,206 --> 00:06:57,125
Why can't I find any cards?

144
00:07:02,881 --> 00:07:04,215
This is driving me crazy.

145
00:07:05,008 --> 00:07:08,386
DEALER ROOM 2

146
00:07:10,805 --> 00:07:13,224
[panting]

147
00:07:14,225 --> 00:07:16,478
[objects clattering]

148
00:07:18,313 --> 00:07:20,315
[♪ suspenseful music continues playing]

149
00:07:26,863 --> 00:07:28,782
NARROWLY ESCAPES THE TAG

150
00:07:33,828 --> 00:07:37,290
[Jaegyun] Joonsu came charging at me,
so I ran away.

151
00:07:37,374 --> 00:07:39,876
But I ended up in a room
that was a dead end.

152
00:07:39,959 --> 00:07:41,044
What color are you?

153
00:07:42,045 --> 00:07:43,588
-White.
-[Jaegyun exclaims]

154
00:07:44,089 --> 00:07:45,382
Stay away from me.

155
00:07:47,550 --> 00:07:49,469
-[laughing]
-[panting]

156
00:07:49,552 --> 00:07:50,804
Come on, Joonsu.

157
00:07:52,722 --> 00:07:53,807
It won't move.

158
00:07:55,975 --> 00:07:57,602
[grunts]

159
00:07:57,686 --> 00:08:00,355
JAEGYUN IS BACKED INTO A CORNER

160
00:08:01,189 --> 00:08:02,399
Everyone's outside.

161
00:08:02,941 --> 00:08:04,109
I said they're outside.

162
00:08:05,318 --> 00:08:07,737
BLOCKS THE RIGHT SIDE WITH A DESK

163
00:08:08,697 --> 00:08:11,449
JOONSU SLOWLY CLOSES IN

164
00:08:12,033 --> 00:08:13,618
You want to send me home?

165
00:08:17,455 --> 00:08:19,874
Can't you let me go one time?
[sighs frustratedly]

166
00:08:24,671 --> 00:08:25,922
GLANCES

167
00:08:31,636 --> 00:08:33,179
-Okay!
-[host] Tag confirmed.

168
00:08:33,263 --> 00:08:34,347
JOONSU TAGS JAEGYUN

169
00:08:34,431 --> 00:08:37,434
HWANG JAEGYUN

170
00:08:37,517 --> 00:08:39,853
[exhales] What do I do now?

171
00:08:44,399 --> 00:08:48,611
[Sanghyun] Once you become a White Card,
you naturally want to go where people are.

172
00:08:48,695 --> 00:08:51,781
There are Dealer Rooms
on the second and third floors.

173
00:08:51,865 --> 00:08:54,159
I figured there'd be
a lot of people there.

174
00:08:54,242 --> 00:08:56,244
[♪ thrilling music playing]

175
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,332
So, I was heading there,

176
00:09:01,416 --> 00:09:03,543
and I noticed something dark
next to a door.

177
00:09:05,795 --> 00:09:06,921
Dail. [laughs]

178
00:09:07,005 --> 00:09:08,006
SPOTS YANG DAIL

179
00:09:08,882 --> 00:09:11,176
-[host] Tag confirmed.
-[Dail] Why would you tag me?

180
00:09:11,259 --> 00:09:12,969
YANG DAIL

181
00:09:13,053 --> 00:09:14,054
[groans]

182
00:09:14,763 --> 00:09:16,639
A White Card player is the scariest.

183
00:09:16,723 --> 00:09:19,350
-Now, I can go after whoever I want.
-Yes, you can.

184
00:09:21,478 --> 00:09:22,479
HORSEKING ENTERS THE ROOM

185
00:09:22,562 --> 00:09:24,481
-Who is it?
-[Horseking] What happened?

186
00:09:25,607 --> 00:09:27,442
[whispering] Ddolddol used a Black Card?

187
00:09:27,525 --> 00:09:30,153
I waited for the Black Card's time
to run out.

188
00:09:30,236 --> 00:09:32,155
I decided I had to get Kim Ddolddol.

189
00:09:32,238 --> 00:09:33,239
What is it? What?

190
00:09:33,323 --> 00:09:34,324
JUST AS BLACK CARD EXPIRES

191
00:09:34,407 --> 00:09:35,867
-[host] Tag confirmed.
-I let my guard down.

192
00:09:35,950 --> 00:09:36,951
HORSEKING TAGS KIM DDOLDDOL

193
00:09:38,036 --> 00:09:39,579
[Ddolddol] It was annoying as hell.

194
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,623
I wanted to get revenge.

195
00:09:41,706 --> 00:09:43,333
KIM DDOLDDOL IS OUT FOR REVENGE

196
00:09:43,416 --> 00:09:45,710
[♪ mysterious music playing]

197
00:09:46,461 --> 00:09:47,754
Horseking, let me tag you.

198
00:09:47,837 --> 00:09:49,130
[Horseking] This is my color.
You're white?

199
00:09:49,214 --> 00:09:50,215
THEY TAG EACH OTHER

200
00:09:50,298 --> 00:09:52,133
-[host] Tag confirmed.
-White... Geez.

201
00:09:52,217 --> 00:09:54,094
Seriously... [laughing]

202
00:09:56,054 --> 00:09:59,474
THE STRONGEST PLAYERS ARE LOCKED
IN THE BLACK AND WHITE ROOM

203
00:10:05,271 --> 00:10:06,439
I'll get you all.

204
00:10:06,523 --> 00:10:08,566
HWANG JAEGYUN STARTS TO MOVE

205
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:12,612
YANG DAIL STARTS TO MOVE

206
00:10:13,696 --> 00:10:17,450
HORSEKING STARTS TO MOVE

207
00:10:24,958 --> 00:10:25,959
[sighs frustratedly]

208
00:10:26,584 --> 00:10:27,919
Where are they all hiding?

209
00:10:29,254 --> 00:10:31,339
All I had to do
was just tag them once I saw them.

210
00:10:31,422 --> 00:10:32,924
It was really frustrating.

211
00:10:33,550 --> 00:10:34,676
Where are they hiding?

212
00:10:35,718 --> 00:10:36,886
[sighs]

213
00:10:38,096 --> 00:10:40,348
I mean, I couldn't find anyone.

214
00:10:40,431 --> 00:10:43,434
Are they having a battle somewhere?
Are they in the Dealer Room?

215
00:10:43,518 --> 00:10:47,063
Like, what's happening?
That's how hard it was to find anyone.

216
00:10:47,689 --> 00:10:48,898
I can't find anybody.

217
00:10:50,108 --> 00:10:53,862
BASEMENT

218
00:10:54,904 --> 00:10:57,323
YANG DAIL SEARCHES THE BASEMENT

219
00:11:00,410 --> 00:11:03,163
When I returned
to the chase area as a White Card,

220
00:11:03,746 --> 00:11:05,498
"NO SIGN OF ANYONE IN BASEMENT"

221
00:11:05,582 --> 00:11:07,709
I went to the basement and looked around.

222
00:11:09,085 --> 00:11:10,086
[sighs frustratedly]

223
00:11:10,170 --> 00:11:11,254
But no one was there.

224
00:11:12,005 --> 00:11:13,298
[exhales] Fuck.

225
00:11:14,174 --> 00:11:17,427
I couldn't find anyone to tag.

226
00:11:20,096 --> 00:11:21,139
3RD FLOOR

227
00:11:21,222 --> 00:11:22,557
-[Horseking] Jaegyun.
-[Jaegyun] Yeah?

228
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:25,310
They're all hiding.
There's nothing we can do. [groans]

229
00:11:26,978 --> 00:11:28,938
By the way, where's Sanghyun hiding?

230
00:11:29,022 --> 00:11:31,441
I don't know.
He's insanely good at hiding.

231
00:11:32,317 --> 00:11:33,484
[both panting softly]

232
00:11:33,568 --> 00:11:34,903
I mean, they're all gone.

233
00:11:34,986 --> 00:11:36,237
[Jaegyun] There's no one.

234
00:11:37,238 --> 00:11:39,324
Where else could they hide
besides the basement?

235
00:11:39,407 --> 00:11:40,992
Is there anywhere else to hide?

236
00:11:41,075 --> 00:11:43,745
I bet there will be someone
hiding in here though.

237
00:11:44,829 --> 00:11:47,248
THE PLAYERS ARE NOWHERE TO BE FOUND

238
00:11:47,332 --> 00:11:49,334
[♪ mysterious music playing]

239
00:11:52,795 --> 00:11:54,130
[Jaegyun exhales]

240
00:11:54,214 --> 00:11:56,382
[panting]

241
00:11:59,469 --> 00:12:01,179
[exhales] Where is everybody?

242
00:12:04,515 --> 00:12:06,517
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

243
00:12:09,604 --> 00:12:11,105
[Joonsu] We were in a tough spot.

244
00:12:11,606 --> 00:12:13,691
We were at risk
of being tagged by a White Card.

245
00:12:13,775 --> 00:12:16,527
RIGHT AFTER TAGGING JAEGYUN

246
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:21,491
I figured hiding
was the best option for now.

247
00:12:24,077 --> 00:12:25,078
[table thuds]

248
00:12:25,161 --> 00:12:28,289
I may be big,
but I'm pretty good at hiding.

249
00:12:42,053 --> 00:12:43,805
PEEKS

250
00:12:43,888 --> 00:12:46,015
DEALER ROOM 2

251
00:12:46,099 --> 00:12:49,060
[Ddolddol] A White Card that can absorb
other colors is basically invincible.

252
00:12:49,143 --> 00:12:51,354
We were pretty much
running out of time at that point.

253
00:12:52,021 --> 00:12:54,107
B1: HWANG JAEGYUN

254
00:12:54,190 --> 00:12:56,192
3F: HORSEKING

255
00:12:56,276 --> 00:12:57,277
2F: YANG DAIL

256
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:59,404
If I were to go out
and end up getting tagged,

257
00:12:59,487 --> 00:13:01,155
I'd be completely isolated,

258
00:13:01,239 --> 00:13:03,533
so being sent out of the game
was a huge disadvantage.

259
00:13:05,076 --> 00:13:07,954
[Sanghyun] I figured it was better
to be on the defensive

260
00:13:08,037 --> 00:13:09,872
and had no choice but to hide.

261
00:13:11,082 --> 00:13:12,792
[whispering] It's so risky being here.

262
00:13:13,418 --> 00:13:15,211
Maybe I should've gone to the basement.

263
00:13:17,463 --> 00:13:19,799
[ZZONE sighs, whispering]
This is driving me crazy.

264
00:13:33,646 --> 00:13:36,399
[Jaegyun sighs impatiently]
I need to tag at least one person.

265
00:13:41,154 --> 00:13:42,280
Where did everyone go?

266
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:47,827
This is driving me crazy.
Where on earth are they hiding?

267
00:13:48,870 --> 00:13:50,663
They sure are good at hiding.

268
00:13:56,836 --> 00:13:58,838
[panting]

269
00:14:01,215 --> 00:14:04,385
[Dail] I couldn't find them.
Where could they be hiding?

270
00:14:05,386 --> 00:14:09,098
At 194 cm and 100 kg,
how can Lee Joonsu be nowhere in sight?

271
00:14:09,182 --> 00:14:11,976
Just how huge is the closet
he's hiding in?

272
00:14:12,060 --> 00:14:13,186
DAIL NEARS JOONSU'S HIDING SPOT

273
00:14:13,269 --> 00:14:14,479
Hey, where is everyone?

274
00:14:18,941 --> 00:14:22,528
[Joonsu] I was so nervous
and scared out of my mind at that moment.

275
00:14:27,825 --> 00:14:30,495
YANG DAIL PASSES BY

276
00:14:30,578 --> 00:14:32,455
I couldn't even breathe.

277
00:14:34,207 --> 00:14:36,626
3RD FLOOR

278
00:14:37,752 --> 00:14:39,587
[sighing] Where are they hiding?

279
00:14:39,670 --> 00:14:41,589
DEALER ROOM 2

280
00:14:45,051 --> 00:14:47,762
DEALER ROOM 2

281
00:14:51,182 --> 00:14:54,727
DEALER ROOM 2

282
00:14:57,647 --> 00:15:01,359
DEALER ROOM 2

283
00:15:01,442 --> 00:15:02,735
TIME LEFT IN ROUND 1

284
00:15:02,819 --> 00:15:04,028
[Horseking] Where are they?

285
00:15:05,029 --> 00:15:07,031
[♪ tense music playing]

286
00:15:08,324 --> 00:15:09,408
[Sanghyun sighs]

287
00:15:10,159 --> 00:15:11,160
[ZZONE sighs]

288
00:15:11,994 --> 00:15:13,496
[Horseking] How am I supposed
to find them?

289
00:15:14,163 --> 00:15:15,164
Let's see.

290
00:15:15,248 --> 00:15:16,666
SEARCHING ROOM ON OPPOSITE SIDE

291
00:15:16,749 --> 00:15:17,834
These punks.

292
00:15:22,547 --> 00:15:25,007
HORSEKING APPROACHES THE HIDING SPOTS

293
00:15:29,137 --> 00:15:32,431
FOOTSTEPS GET LOUDER

294
00:15:39,647 --> 00:15:41,691
HORSEKING PASSES BY ZZONE

295
00:15:47,822 --> 00:15:49,615
TOWARD THE ROOM WHERE SANGHYUN IS

296
00:15:54,245 --> 00:15:55,246
[Horseking sighs]

297
00:16:01,419 --> 00:16:03,296
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

298
00:16:08,092 --> 00:16:09,677
HORSEKING WALKS PAST THE BATHROOM

299
00:16:09,760 --> 00:16:10,928
Seriously, where are they?

300
00:16:12,263 --> 00:16:15,266
[Sanghyun] As he passed by, it felt like
my heart was pounding against the walls.

301
00:16:20,897 --> 00:16:24,025
TIME LEFT IN ROUND 1

302
00:16:24,108 --> 00:16:25,151
[Horseking] It felt like

303
00:16:26,194 --> 00:16:28,029
something was in there.

304
00:16:31,782 --> 00:16:33,784
[footsteps approaching]

305
00:16:34,285 --> 00:16:36,329
[Sanghyun] Then, I heard noises again.

306
00:16:39,749 --> 00:16:42,668
TIME LEFT IN ROUND 1

307
00:16:46,797 --> 00:16:49,133
-[buzzer goes off]
-[Horseking] I was too late.

308
00:16:49,217 --> 00:16:51,469
[host] Round 1's chase is over.

309
00:16:51,552 --> 00:16:52,720
[cackling]

310
00:16:54,388 --> 00:16:56,974
Oh my gosh! That really scared me!

311
00:16:57,475 --> 00:16:58,517
[exhales]

312
00:16:58,601 --> 00:17:03,231
I was just about to tag Sanghyun
at the end, but time ran out.

313
00:17:03,314 --> 00:17:08,527
He was literally right in front of me.
I was this close to tagging him.

314
00:17:08,611 --> 00:17:10,196
But then... [clicks tongue]

315
00:17:11,364 --> 00:17:15,159
I realized I made a huge miscalculation.

316
00:17:15,243 --> 00:17:16,994
[host] The chase is over.

317
00:17:17,536 --> 00:17:19,830
I don't see anybody! Where is everyone?

318
00:17:19,914 --> 00:17:21,582
I swear, you couldn't find them.

319
00:17:21,666 --> 00:17:23,834
My biggest regrets from Round 1

320
00:17:23,918 --> 00:17:26,337
were not knowing
how everyone would hide like that

321
00:17:26,420 --> 00:17:27,755
and going easy on Junseo.

322
00:17:28,422 --> 00:17:29,966
[sighs]

323
00:17:30,508 --> 00:17:31,509
[exhales]

324
00:17:31,592 --> 00:17:35,096
[Jaegyun]
It was honestly kind of ridiculous.

325
00:17:36,264 --> 00:17:38,766
I was really kicking myself.

326
00:17:38,849 --> 00:17:41,227
I was very disappointed.

327
00:17:41,310 --> 00:17:44,647
[host] All players, please gather
in the Black and White Zone.

328
00:17:45,565 --> 00:17:47,900
[♪ intriguing music playing]

329
00:18:01,163 --> 00:18:02,623
There aren't many hiding spots here.

330
00:18:02,707 --> 00:18:04,041
[Horseking] He's in there.

331
00:18:04,125 --> 00:18:05,668
How much time is left?

332
00:18:06,460 --> 00:18:09,297
-Seriously, where are they?
-[Junseo] They're all hiding.

333
00:18:13,801 --> 00:18:15,386
What? I'm not the Seeker.

334
00:18:16,679 --> 00:18:17,680
Hey.

335
00:18:18,347 --> 00:18:20,474
Sanghyun, it's been a while
since I've seen you.

336
00:18:22,602 --> 00:18:24,145
[mic feedback]

337
00:18:24,228 --> 00:18:26,439
[host] We will now announce
the rankings for Round 1.

338
00:18:30,026 --> 00:18:31,319
In a tie for first place,

339
00:18:32,486 --> 00:18:33,487
Kim Ddolddol

340
00:18:33,571 --> 00:18:35,072
"DDOLDDOL"

341
00:18:35,156 --> 00:18:36,157
and Youn Sanghyun.

342
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:37,241
SANGHYUN

343
00:18:37,325 --> 00:18:39,660
[Sanghyun] The plan
to wait things out worked.

344
00:18:39,744 --> 00:18:41,829
I'll keep waiting it out in Round 2.

345
00:18:41,912 --> 00:18:43,998
My gosh, it's unbelievable.
It's all going so well.

346
00:18:44,081 --> 00:18:47,460
I figured I would need
to keep hiding in Round 2 as well.

347
00:18:47,543 --> 00:18:48,878
[host] In a tie for sixth place,

348
00:18:49,712 --> 00:18:50,713
Horseking

349
00:18:50,796 --> 00:18:51,964
"HORSEKING"

350
00:18:52,048 --> 00:18:53,591
-and Yang Dail.
-[sighs]

351
00:18:53,674 --> 00:18:55,593
DAIL

352
00:18:55,676 --> 00:18:56,802
In eighth place,

353
00:18:56,886 --> 00:18:57,887
Hwang Jaegyun.

354
00:18:57,970 --> 00:18:58,971
JAEGYUN

355
00:18:59,055 --> 00:19:00,056
[Jaegyun] I was in last place.

356
00:19:00,139 --> 00:19:04,769
The game wasn't playing out
the way I had planned.

357
00:19:04,852 --> 00:19:06,854
We were tagged,

358
00:19:06,937 --> 00:19:09,523
lost points, and fell to the bottom
of the rankings.

359
00:19:09,607 --> 00:19:10,608
STRONG PLAYERS AT THE BOTTOM

360
00:19:10,691 --> 00:19:12,109
I thought if I ran around,

361
00:19:12,193 --> 00:19:15,821
I'd be able to make at least the top two,
if not first place.

362
00:19:15,905 --> 00:19:18,366
[Dail] Being near the bottom
of the rankings

363
00:19:18,449 --> 00:19:20,743
made me really mad at myself.

364
00:19:20,826 --> 00:19:21,952
TIED FOR 1ST
DDOLDDOL, SANGHYUN

365
00:19:22,036 --> 00:19:23,287
TIED FOR 3RD
ZZONE, JOONSU, JUNSEO

366
00:19:23,371 --> 00:19:24,372
TIED FOR 6TH
HORSEKING, DAIL

367
00:19:24,455 --> 00:19:25,456
8TH
JAEGYUN

368
00:19:29,085 --> 00:19:31,379
The two people who were hidden
are in first and second.

369
00:19:32,755 --> 00:19:36,300
You, Horseking, and I
were the only ones walking around.

370
00:19:36,384 --> 00:19:37,635
They hid so well.

371
00:19:38,219 --> 00:19:41,013
Why are these guys
trying so hard at this game?

372
00:19:41,097 --> 00:19:42,431
That really gets on my nerves.

373
00:19:42,515 --> 00:19:46,268
I know it might seem cowardly,
but it's all about not losing points.

374
00:19:46,352 --> 00:19:49,105
So I figured the smart thing
was to play defense.

375
00:19:49,188 --> 00:19:51,357
-It's only us going around.
-[Jaegyun] Exactly.

376
00:19:52,441 --> 00:19:55,653
They said that everyone was hiding,
so they couldn't play the game right

377
00:19:55,736 --> 00:19:57,154
and that it was frustrating.

378
00:19:57,238 --> 00:20:00,449
But this strategy gave us
way more of an advantage.

379
00:20:01,075 --> 00:20:03,577
Who asked you to tag us?

380
00:20:05,621 --> 00:20:08,082
I'll find everyone who hides this round.
You're so dead.

381
00:20:09,375 --> 00:20:12,044
You need a color
to tag someone. [snickers]

382
00:20:16,048 --> 00:20:17,466
[Dail] I got so angry.

383
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:25,933
I have to win, no matter what.
I'm going to give it all I got.

384
00:20:27,601 --> 00:20:28,811
[sighs deeply]

385
00:20:32,314 --> 00:20:36,986
[host] We will now begin
the Color Selection phase for Round 2.

386
00:20:37,069 --> 00:20:39,780
[♪ thrilling music playing]

387
00:20:39,864 --> 00:20:40,865
Mr. Yuk Junseo.

388
00:20:40,948 --> 00:20:42,324
Please select a color card.

389
00:20:42,908 --> 00:20:46,912
You have selected yellow.
Your number is five.

390
00:20:46,996 --> 00:20:48,122
Mr. Youn Sanghyun.

391
00:20:48,706 --> 00:20:50,958
You have chosen the red card.

392
00:20:51,459 --> 00:20:52,460
Mr. Kim Ddolddol.

393
00:20:53,335 --> 00:20:54,795
[Ddolddol] We had formed an alliance...

394
00:20:54,879 --> 00:20:56,589
-I'll go with this one.
-Okay.

395
00:20:56,672 --> 00:20:57,840
The yellow card.

396
00:20:57,923 --> 00:20:59,467
DDOLDDOL PICKED THE SAME COLOR AS JUNSEO

397
00:20:59,550 --> 00:21:01,510
[Ddolddol] I just chose the one
that worked in my favor.

398
00:21:02,219 --> 00:21:04,513
[Sanghyun] We were each supposed
to pick different colors,

399
00:21:04,597 --> 00:21:06,390
but we ended up
with one red and two yellows.

400
00:21:06,474 --> 00:21:07,892
So the whole plan became meaningless.

401
00:21:07,975 --> 00:21:10,144
It seemed like the alliance
became pointless,

402
00:21:10,227 --> 00:21:12,730
so I decided to play for myself.

403
00:21:13,272 --> 00:21:14,732
EMPTY ALLIANCE AMONG THOSE AT THE TOP

404
00:21:14,815 --> 00:21:16,275
[Joonsu] Next person may go in.

405
00:21:16,358 --> 00:21:17,777
Okay, Mr. Hwang Jaegyun.

406
00:21:17,860 --> 00:21:18,861
Ms. ZZONE.

407
00:21:18,944 --> 00:21:20,946
Mr. Yang Dail. Mr. Horseking.

408
00:21:21,030 --> 00:21:23,032
Mr. Lee Joonsu, please choose your card.

409
00:21:23,115 --> 00:21:25,117
ROUND 2 COLOR SELECTION
JAEGYUN, ZZONE, SANGHYUN

410
00:21:25,201 --> 00:21:26,786
DDOLDDOL, JUNSEO, HORSEKING

411
00:21:26,869 --> 00:21:28,496
DAIL, JOONSU

412
00:21:30,790 --> 00:21:33,209
[Ddolddol] Who was the person
who changed my color to green?

413
00:21:33,292 --> 00:21:34,752
Who changed mine to purple?

414
00:21:34,835 --> 00:21:36,754
-[ZZONE] So all your colors have changed?
-Yes.

415
00:21:36,837 --> 00:21:39,298
-Who changed my color to purple?
-[Sanghyun] The color card.

416
00:21:39,381 --> 00:21:40,841
[♪ intriguing music playing]

417
00:21:43,719 --> 00:21:45,179
[Ddolddol whispering] Trade, quick.

418
00:21:45,262 --> 00:21:48,432
CHANGED DAIL'S COLOR
USING THE CARD DDOLDDOL GAVE HIM

419
00:21:48,516 --> 00:21:50,434
-Yang Dail.
-This will be applied to Yang Dail

420
00:21:50,518 --> 00:21:52,937
-to change the color to purple.
-[Sanghyun] Okay.

421
00:21:53,020 --> 00:21:54,021
Come on, somebody did it.

422
00:21:54,104 --> 00:21:55,648
-Why won't you tell me?
-[Horseking] About what?

423
00:21:55,731 --> 00:21:58,317
-Who changed mine to purple?
-Someone changed him to purple.

424
00:21:58,400 --> 00:22:00,694
I was afraid they might suspect me again,

425
00:22:00,778 --> 00:22:02,446
so I just stayed quiet.

426
00:22:02,530 --> 00:22:05,658
[players chattering indistinctly]

427
00:22:05,741 --> 00:22:07,034
Was it you? You turned me purple.

428
00:22:07,117 --> 00:22:09,286
[Joonsu] I've never even picked up
a color card.

429
00:22:09,370 --> 00:22:10,371
It was you, right?

430
00:22:10,454 --> 00:22:12,957
Why would I change yours? I had orange.

431
00:22:13,040 --> 00:22:15,751
Ah. Then, who on earth changed mine?

432
00:22:16,627 --> 00:22:21,799
I have a feeling the Seeker mission
might have something to do with it,

433
00:22:21,882 --> 00:22:27,638
so I asked people there
and tried to read their reactions.

434
00:22:27,721 --> 00:22:31,016
Listen. No one is admitting
that they changed my color.

435
00:22:31,100 --> 00:22:32,726
Whoever changed it is the Seeker.

436
00:22:32,810 --> 00:22:34,270
It's the Seeker's mission?

437
00:22:34,353 --> 00:22:36,188
-Changing colors.
-[Dail] This has to be the mission.

438
00:22:36,272 --> 00:22:37,982
No one is saying they did it.

439
00:22:38,774 --> 00:22:40,860
But there's no reason
to bring it up, so...

440
00:22:41,443 --> 00:22:43,153
No, why would there be no reason?

441
00:22:43,654 --> 00:22:44,947
-[Joonsu] No.
-It has to be the Seeker.

442
00:22:45,030 --> 00:22:46,365
That's why they can't talk.

443
00:22:46,949 --> 00:22:48,409
Maybe it's their own strategy.

444
00:22:49,743 --> 00:22:51,787
You keep making excuses.
Are you the Seeker?

445
00:22:51,871 --> 00:22:53,581
-No.
-[all laugh]

446
00:22:53,664 --> 00:22:56,458
-[Dail] You're making excuses.
-You don't need to show all your cards.

447
00:22:56,542 --> 00:22:59,712
The one who seemed
the most suspicious was Ddolddol.

448
00:23:00,754 --> 00:23:02,965
-Ddolddol, you're the Seeker, aren't you?
-[Ddolddol] No.

449
00:23:03,048 --> 00:23:05,509
I bet Ddolddol is the Seeker.

450
00:23:05,593 --> 00:23:09,263
Today, he kept avoiding
eye contact with me.

451
00:23:12,683 --> 00:23:15,644
Dail said we should all just come clean,

452
00:23:15,728 --> 00:23:17,438
and then he started questioning me.

453
00:23:17,521 --> 00:23:19,523
Like an interrogation. What is he, a cop?

454
00:23:19,607 --> 00:23:20,941
It really got on my nerves.

455
00:23:21,567 --> 00:23:23,193
Can I say something?

456
00:23:24,570 --> 00:23:26,405
I know who the Seeker is.

457
00:23:26,488 --> 00:23:29,033
-Really?
-Yes, I found the Seeker. I'm certain.

458
00:23:29,116 --> 00:23:31,994
The Seeker is Kim Ddolddol for sure.

459
00:23:32,077 --> 00:23:33,245
-What?
-Yes.

460
00:23:35,080 --> 00:23:37,041
You used a Black Card.

461
00:23:38,292 --> 00:23:40,419
I picked up the Black Card
while searching.

462
00:23:41,003 --> 00:23:42,254
What was the Black Card puzzle?

463
00:23:43,464 --> 00:23:45,007
I forgot. It was some number quiz.

464
00:23:45,090 --> 00:23:46,467
Number quiz?

465
00:23:48,344 --> 00:23:51,722
[Jaegyun] It seemed like
he was hiding something the whole time.

466
00:23:52,348 --> 00:23:54,224
That was pretty apparent.

467
00:23:54,725 --> 00:23:59,563
The more he did that,
the more suspicious we got of Ddolddol.

468
00:23:59,647 --> 00:24:01,023
So, he must be the Seeker.

469
00:24:03,317 --> 00:24:06,362
To get Ddolddol, do I need to be orange?

470
00:24:07,780 --> 00:24:09,865
To get Ddolddol...

471
00:24:09,949 --> 00:24:11,992
We need to turn
this whole thing upside down.

472
00:24:12,952 --> 00:24:16,038
[Ddolddol] I wasn't scared at all.
Go ahead and talk all you want.

473
00:24:16,121 --> 00:24:18,916
I'll follow Ddolddol around in the game
and look for items together.

474
00:24:18,999 --> 00:24:20,000
[Jaegyun laughing]

475
00:24:22,836 --> 00:24:24,505
Are you the Seeker? Be honest.

476
00:24:24,588 --> 00:24:25,673
I told you it's not me.

477
00:24:26,256 --> 00:24:27,549
I wish I were the Seeker.

478
00:24:28,467 --> 00:24:30,260
I've settled on one person.

479
00:24:30,344 --> 00:24:31,470
[ZZONE] Really?

480
00:24:32,262 --> 00:24:33,263
Who?

481
00:24:34,390 --> 00:24:36,850
[mouthing] Jaegyun.

482
00:24:37,518 --> 00:24:39,228
I was sure it had to be Jaegyun.

483
00:24:39,853 --> 00:24:41,772
[sighs, murmurs] I think it's Jaegyun.

484
00:24:42,648 --> 00:24:44,775
Doesn't Jaegyun seem like the Seeker?

485
00:24:44,858 --> 00:24:46,193
[mouthing] Really?

486
00:24:48,028 --> 00:24:50,447
By the way, why is it so hard
to find the stairs?

487
00:24:52,825 --> 00:24:56,578
-[Jaegyun exclaims]
-Jaegyun kind of seems awkward.

488
00:24:56,662 --> 00:24:59,623
Don't you think so?
You feel it too, right?

489
00:24:59,707 --> 00:25:01,542
-[ZZONE] No reason? Just a hunch?
-I'm still not sure.

490
00:25:02,126 --> 00:25:03,377
That's a relief.

491
00:25:03,460 --> 00:25:05,546
-You having a hunch isn't good.
-[Ddolddol and ZZONE laugh]

492
00:25:05,629 --> 00:25:07,589
-Do the opposite instead?
-What a relief.

493
00:25:08,173 --> 00:25:11,677
[host] Round 2's Color Tag phase
will now begin.

494
00:25:12,302 --> 00:25:16,265
The first player, Hwang Jaegyun,
please enter the chase area.

495
00:25:18,225 --> 00:25:21,687
[Jaegyun] The card color determines
who you can and can't tag,

496
00:25:22,312 --> 00:25:24,523
so I figured I had to find a lot of cards.

497
00:25:29,403 --> 00:25:31,905
[host] The second player, Yang Dail.

498
00:25:32,489 --> 00:25:34,992
[Dail] I hated that I was starting Round 2
of this semifinal

499
00:25:35,075 --> 00:25:37,911
at the bottom of the rankings
with minus 10 points.

500
00:25:37,995 --> 00:25:41,582
I thought,
"Was I really this bad at games?"

501
00:25:41,665 --> 00:25:43,917
I'll do whatever it takes
to turn this around.

502
00:25:44,960 --> 00:25:48,964
[host] The third player,
Youn Sanghyun, please start.

503
00:25:52,968 --> 00:25:55,804
[Sanghyun] I was already at the top,
so I wanted to maintain my score.

504
00:25:55,888 --> 00:25:58,766
I was going to wait it out again.
Time to hold out again.

505
00:26:00,350 --> 00:26:02,811
[Ddolddol] Once you start tagging
one another,

506
00:26:02,895 --> 00:26:04,563
you keep losing points.

507
00:26:04,646 --> 00:26:06,899
I figured I'd just hide
and let them tag each other.

508
00:26:06,982 --> 00:26:08,567
Fight among yourselves!

509
00:26:09,777 --> 00:26:11,153
[Joonsu] Right now,
hiding's the best option.

510
00:26:12,905 --> 00:26:14,823
[ZZONE] It's better for our survival.

511
00:26:15,407 --> 00:26:17,785
MOST OF THE TOP-RANKED PLAYERS ARE HIDING

512
00:26:20,913 --> 00:26:22,498
I found a blue card!

513
00:26:22,581 --> 00:26:23,791
LOW-RANKED PLAYERS ARE SEARCHING

514
00:26:31,507 --> 00:26:32,883
[alarm blaring]

515
00:26:32,966 --> 00:26:35,928
[host] All players
have entered the chase area.

516
00:26:36,011 --> 00:26:38,472
You may now start tagging.

517
00:26:44,061 --> 00:26:46,730
JAEGYUN'S SEARCHING FOR CARDS

518
00:26:47,981 --> 00:26:50,025
SOMEONE HAS CHANGED HWANG JAEGYUN'S COLOR

519
00:26:50,109 --> 00:26:54,530
PLEASE GO TO THE DEALER ROOM NOW

520
00:26:54,613 --> 00:26:57,825
[Jaegyun] Someone changed my color
as soon as the game started.

521
00:26:57,908 --> 00:27:01,662
I didn't know who it was
and wondered what was going on.

522
00:27:04,706 --> 00:27:06,625
-[dealer] Hello, Mr. Hwang Jaegyun.
-Hello.

523
00:27:06,708 --> 00:27:10,254
[dealer] Your color
has been changed to purple.

524
00:27:11,672 --> 00:27:14,007
AT THAT MOMENT,
DAIL ARRIVES AT THE DEALER ROOM

525
00:27:14,800 --> 00:27:15,801
CHECKING THE SIGN'S LIGHT

526
00:27:15,884 --> 00:27:17,719
YANG DAIL

527
00:27:18,345 --> 00:27:21,348
DAIL CAN TAG JAEGYUN

528
00:27:22,182 --> 00:27:25,310
[Dail] There's no way to know which color
a player in the Dealer Room has.

529
00:27:25,394 --> 00:27:28,063
But I hid behind the door just in case.

530
00:27:28,897 --> 00:27:29,898
CHECKING THE COLOR

531
00:27:31,567 --> 00:27:33,443
HORSEKING CAME TO THE DEALER ROOM TOO

532
00:27:35,946 --> 00:27:37,364
HORSEKING AND DAIL CAN'T TAG EACH OTHER

533
00:27:37,447 --> 00:27:39,116
[chuckles] Were you waiting too?

534
00:27:40,409 --> 00:27:41,493
Hey, where's Sanghyun?

535
00:27:43,078 --> 00:27:44,705
-Have you seen Sanghyun?
-[Horseking] No.

536
00:27:44,788 --> 00:27:46,665
[sighs frustratedly] Where is he hiding?

537
00:27:48,625 --> 00:27:51,420
[Dail] Jaegyun came out
with the color I could tag.

538
00:27:53,547 --> 00:27:55,591
I hesitated for a half second.

539
00:27:55,674 --> 00:27:59,553
Once we start tagging each other,
it'd only be us losing points.

540
00:28:01,305 --> 00:28:02,890
[Horseking] What are you doing?
You're not going in?

541
00:28:02,973 --> 00:28:04,391
[Dail] But I had to tag him.

542
00:28:05,309 --> 00:28:07,269
I'm here on this show to win.

543
00:28:08,186 --> 00:28:09,563
[Jaegyun] Why are you chasing me?

544
00:28:28,040 --> 00:28:30,167
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

545
00:28:33,795 --> 00:28:35,756
[Jaegyun exhales frustratedly, yelps]

546
00:28:35,839 --> 00:28:36,965
DAIL'S PERSISTENT CHASE

547
00:28:37,049 --> 00:28:38,050
Hey!

548
00:28:38,133 --> 00:28:39,885
[panting]

549
00:28:39,968 --> 00:28:42,888
I can do it.
I can catch them. I can survive.

550
00:28:53,899 --> 00:28:55,776
[Jaegyun sighing in exhaustion]

551
00:28:55,859 --> 00:28:57,444
[Dail panting]

552
00:28:58,195 --> 00:28:59,196
DAIL TAGS JAEGYUN

553
00:28:59,279 --> 00:29:00,697
-[host] Tag confirmed.
-What's with you?

554
00:29:00,781 --> 00:29:01,782
HWANG JAEGYUN

555
00:29:01,865 --> 00:29:03,200
[Dail] I'm blue.

556
00:29:03,283 --> 00:29:05,827
YANG DAIL

557
00:29:05,911 --> 00:29:07,204
We have to go together.

558
00:29:07,287 --> 00:29:09,289
[both panting heavily]

559
00:29:11,750 --> 00:29:13,585
[sighs] I'm at minus five points now.

560
00:29:13,669 --> 00:29:17,130
I'm going to claw my way back up.
I'll turn this around.

561
00:29:18,173 --> 00:29:20,842
DAIL TAGGED JAEGYUN

562
00:29:20,926 --> 00:29:23,345
[Ddolddol] I got a message.

563
00:29:23,929 --> 00:29:26,264
"Yang Dail tagged Hwang Jaegyun."

564
00:29:28,141 --> 00:29:31,311
My plan worked.
What was the point of intimidating me?

565
00:29:32,145 --> 00:29:34,147
I know who the Seeker is.

566
00:29:34,231 --> 00:29:35,941
The Seeker is Kim Ddolddol.

567
00:29:36,024 --> 00:29:37,025
-What?
-Yes.

568
00:29:37,109 --> 00:29:40,487
To get Ddolddol, do I need to be orange?

569
00:29:40,570 --> 00:29:44,533
It really got on my nerves then,
and I wanted to get revenge.

570
00:29:44,616 --> 00:29:45,617
DEALER ROOM

571
00:29:45,701 --> 00:29:47,703
5 MINUTES BEFORE TAGGING STARTED

572
00:29:48,370 --> 00:29:51,623
-[dealer] Okay, a blue card.
-I'll use this to turn Jaegyun purple.

573
00:29:51,707 --> 00:29:54,626
[dealer] This will be applied
to Hwang Jaegyun.

574
00:29:54,710 --> 00:29:58,338
I knocked Jaegyun down to purple,
so he could be chased by Yang Dail.

575
00:29:58,422 --> 00:30:00,007
I changed him to purple.

576
00:30:00,090 --> 00:30:01,133
It was thrilling.

577
00:30:02,718 --> 00:30:05,762
LOW-RANKED PLAYERS BATTLE IT OUT
AS DDOLDDOL PLANNED

578
00:30:07,264 --> 00:30:09,891
HWANG JAEGYUN

579
00:30:11,059 --> 00:30:12,978
[♪ foreboding music plays]

580
00:30:13,061 --> 00:30:14,062
[Dail] I'll use this red

581
00:30:14,146 --> 00:30:15,981
to turn it purple.

582
00:30:16,064 --> 00:30:18,442
Your red card will be used

583
00:30:18,525 --> 00:30:21,028
-to change the color to purple.
-Thank you.

584
00:30:21,111 --> 00:30:23,196
There were probably a lot of red players,

585
00:30:23,280 --> 00:30:25,323
so I switched colors
to be able to tag them.

586
00:30:26,241 --> 00:30:27,451
Where are they?

587
00:30:37,878 --> 00:30:39,880
[footsteps approaching]

588
00:30:41,965 --> 00:30:45,135
I heard footsteps, so I decided to hide.

589
00:30:47,637 --> 00:30:49,639
[footsteps approaching]

590
00:31:00,942 --> 00:31:03,653
-[groans loudly] Geez, I'm fucked.
-Come here. Come on.

591
00:31:03,737 --> 00:31:04,946
MEETS JAEGYUN AGAIN AFTER TAGGING

592
00:31:05,030 --> 00:31:07,240
[Jaegyun] Come on.
You deserve to be caught.

593
00:31:13,371 --> 00:31:17,000
JAEGYUN BLOCKS THE WAY OUT

594
00:31:20,921 --> 00:31:22,506
[Dail] I'm pretty strong.

595
00:31:24,049 --> 00:31:25,801
[Jaegyun] You deserve to be caught.

596
00:31:27,928 --> 00:31:30,847
But a national team baseball player
is on another level.

597
00:31:30,931 --> 00:31:34,893
He was way too strong
when he was pushing the desk.

598
00:31:37,521 --> 00:31:39,272
I thought the right side might be open,

599
00:31:39,856 --> 00:31:41,024
so I made a run for it.

600
00:31:50,867 --> 00:31:52,035
-[grunts]
-Watch out.

601
00:31:52,994 --> 00:31:54,663
-[grunts]
-Watch out.

602
00:31:54,746 --> 00:31:56,915
[groans] Fuck.

603
00:31:59,668 --> 00:32:01,586
[host] Tag confirmed.

604
00:32:01,670 --> 00:32:03,588
[Dail] This fucking sucks.

605
00:32:04,923 --> 00:32:08,135
As soon as I tagged Jaegyun,
he tagged me right back.

606
00:32:08,218 --> 00:32:09,970
I became a White Card again.

607
00:32:10,971 --> 00:32:11,972
[sighs frustratedly]

608
00:32:13,140 --> 00:32:14,141
[exhales]

609
00:32:16,017 --> 00:32:18,019
[♪ intriguing music playing]

610
00:32:19,146 --> 00:32:20,772
We were fighting among ourselves again.

611
00:32:20,856 --> 00:32:24,151
This is exactly what they wanted.

612
00:32:24,651 --> 00:32:26,862
I was so frustrated and mad.

613
00:32:27,571 --> 00:32:28,572
[exhales]

614
00:32:31,533 --> 00:32:32,576
[seething]

615
00:32:35,871 --> 00:32:37,289
I'm going to find all of you.

616
00:32:37,372 --> 00:32:40,375
SEARCHING FROM THE FIRST FLOOR AGAIN

617
00:32:44,796 --> 00:32:45,797
I'll find all of you.

618
00:32:45,881 --> 00:32:48,258
TIME LEFT UNTIL ELIMINATION

619
00:32:49,426 --> 00:32:51,428
[♪ music intensifies]

620
00:32:58,018 --> 00:33:00,061
Someone should be here.

621
00:33:01,855 --> 00:33:04,816
DAIL DIDN'T FIND ZZONE

622
00:33:07,652 --> 00:33:09,029
No one was on the first three floors.

623
00:33:09,112 --> 00:33:12,157
Why are they so good at hiding?

624
00:33:12,240 --> 00:33:15,577
TIME LEFT UNTIL ELIMINATION

625
00:33:15,660 --> 00:33:18,205
Please show yourselves.

626
00:33:21,666 --> 00:33:23,668
[♪ intense music playing]

627
00:33:24,377 --> 00:33:25,462
-What color?
-[Dail] What color?

628
00:33:31,927 --> 00:33:32,928
-Goodness!
-[Junseo grunts]

629
00:33:33,511 --> 00:33:35,263
-Goodness!
-[Junseo grunts]

630
00:33:36,306 --> 00:33:37,307
What color are you?

631
00:33:38,558 --> 00:33:39,809
[host] Tag confirmed.

632
00:33:39,893 --> 00:33:40,894
DAIL TAGS JUNSEO

633
00:33:41,645 --> 00:33:44,940
[dealer] Yang Dail has tagged Yuk Junseo.

634
00:33:45,732 --> 00:33:49,945
I tagged two people,
but my score was still at minus 10.

635
00:33:50,028 --> 00:33:51,071
TIED FOR 1ST
DDOLDDOL, SANGHYUN

636
00:33:51,154 --> 00:33:52,572
TIED FOR 3RD: ZZONE, JOONSU
5TH: JUNSEO

637
00:33:52,656 --> 00:33:54,241
TIED FOR 6TH: HORSEKING, DAIL
8TH: JAEGYUN

638
00:33:58,078 --> 00:33:59,371
[♪ tense music playing]

639
00:33:59,454 --> 00:34:01,206
KIM DDOLDDOL

640
00:34:01,289 --> 00:34:04,376
This is my perfect little fortress.

641
00:34:05,418 --> 00:34:07,003
There's no way I'll get caught.

642
00:34:08,713 --> 00:34:10,882
YOUN SANGHYUN

643
00:34:11,466 --> 00:34:14,302
ZZONE

644
00:34:15,345 --> 00:34:18,056
LEE JOONSU

645
00:34:18,139 --> 00:34:21,184
THE TOP 4 STAY HIDDEN

646
00:34:23,103 --> 00:34:25,397
Hey, this is so frustrating.
I can't stand it.

647
00:34:25,480 --> 00:34:27,065
Let's take out the ones who are hiding.

648
00:34:27,148 --> 00:34:28,900
We should, but I can't fucking find them.

649
00:34:28,984 --> 00:34:30,443
[Dail] We should take out
those hiding punks.

650
00:34:30,527 --> 00:34:32,028
They're gone!

651
00:34:32,112 --> 00:34:33,530
I can't find them.

652
00:34:33,613 --> 00:34:36,449
To be honest, I don't like
stall tactics to run out the clock.

653
00:34:36,533 --> 00:34:37,784
That's just how I am.

654
00:34:41,997 --> 00:34:42,998
[Dail] What color are you?

655
00:34:43,081 --> 00:34:44,374
YUK JUNSEO

656
00:34:44,457 --> 00:34:46,209
I won't. I'm white, but I won't tag you.

657
00:34:46,293 --> 00:34:47,335
Where are the others?

658
00:34:47,419 --> 00:34:49,045
-[Dail] What?
-Where are the others?

659
00:34:49,129 --> 00:34:50,588
[Dail whispering] He just went downstairs.

660
00:34:50,672 --> 00:34:52,424
No, go around.

661
00:34:52,507 --> 00:34:53,758
JUNSEO DOESN'T TAG DAIL

662
00:34:53,842 --> 00:34:57,804
[Junseo] Dail spared me once,
and then we just kept fighting each other.

663
00:34:57,887 --> 00:35:01,516
I felt like the game was becoming
more unfavorable to us.

664
00:35:01,600 --> 00:35:03,643
I realized we shouldn't go on like this,

665
00:35:03,727 --> 00:35:06,313
so I went after those who were hiding.

666
00:35:06,396 --> 00:35:09,733
I ran into Junseo a lot that day.

667
00:35:09,816 --> 00:35:11,526
Now that I think about it,

668
00:35:11,610 --> 00:35:14,863
only those who weren't hiding
kept bumping into each other.

669
00:35:14,946 --> 00:35:15,947
Horseking.

670
00:35:16,698 --> 00:35:18,241
-Jaegyun.
-[Jaegyun] Hey!

671
00:35:18,908 --> 00:35:20,368
-[Dail] Junseo.
-Sorry.

672
00:35:21,202 --> 00:35:23,538
The one who really got under my skin
was Youn Sanghyun.

673
00:35:23,622 --> 00:35:26,166
I saw him only once that day.

674
00:35:26,958 --> 00:35:27,959
[Dail] Why would you tag me?

675
00:35:28,043 --> 00:35:29,544
SANGHYUN HID AFTER TAGGING IN ROUND 1

676
00:35:29,628 --> 00:35:32,005
That's how good Sanghyun was at hiding.

677
00:35:32,088 --> 00:35:34,090
He was like a master of hiding.

678
00:35:34,174 --> 00:35:35,800
Why is he so good at hiding?

679
00:35:36,718 --> 00:35:40,680
DAIL HEADS DOWN TO THE 1ST FLOOR

680
00:35:43,183 --> 00:35:45,018
[sighs] I can't get eliminated here.

681
00:35:47,354 --> 00:35:48,355
Hold on.

682
00:35:50,190 --> 00:35:52,192
[♪ thrilling music playing]

683
00:35:57,280 --> 00:36:00,241
YOUN SANGHYUN

684
00:36:00,325 --> 00:36:03,036
They say things
are usually right under your nose.

685
00:36:03,119 --> 00:36:05,789
The first floor seemed perfect
for hiding in plain sight.

686
00:36:05,872 --> 00:36:08,875
When I went around as a White Card,

687
00:36:08,958 --> 00:36:11,419
there were a lot of people
on the second and third floors,

688
00:36:11,503 --> 00:36:14,381
so I decided to hide
on the first floor, no matter what.

689
00:36:14,464 --> 00:36:16,675
Like that half-open door,

690
00:36:16,758 --> 00:36:20,679
I went for spots
that they wouldn't bother checking.

691
00:36:20,762 --> 00:36:22,389
And sure enough, no one caught on.

692
00:36:24,974 --> 00:36:28,436
BLACK AND WHITE ZONE
ISOLATION ZONE, CARD SELECTION ZONE

693
00:36:28,520 --> 00:36:30,063
I give up. I can't find them.

694
00:36:30,563 --> 00:36:32,816
Seriously, I give up. I can't find them.

695
00:36:32,899 --> 00:36:34,150
I was almost ready to give up.

696
00:36:34,234 --> 00:36:38,029
I was so frustrated and upset,
and I just couldn't figure out

697
00:36:38,113 --> 00:36:39,864
how to catch those hidden players.

698
00:36:39,948 --> 00:36:42,075
There was no way I could find them.

699
00:36:42,158 --> 00:36:45,787
So, I thought I needed to give everything
I had in the Death Match.

700
00:36:45,870 --> 00:36:48,331
DAIL IS ROAMING AROUND THE BASEMENT

701
00:36:49,374 --> 00:36:50,583
FOUND A COLOR CARD

702
00:36:54,504 --> 00:36:56,214
[softly] It's another blue one. Fuck.

703
00:37:01,886 --> 00:37:03,888
[♪ mysterious music playing]

704
00:37:09,269 --> 00:37:10,895
Then, I really thought about it.

705
00:37:12,647 --> 00:37:15,608
There was something
in the first and second rounds

706
00:37:15,692 --> 00:37:16,943
that I had completely missed.

707
00:37:17,026 --> 00:37:19,446
All I did was complain
about people hiding.

708
00:37:19,529 --> 00:37:24,033
But I finally came up with a way
to get them to come out.

709
00:37:27,620 --> 00:37:30,081
DAIL HEADS SOMEWHERE IN A HURRY

710
00:37:40,175 --> 00:37:41,217
[Sanghyun] This is crazy.

711
00:37:46,514 --> 00:37:47,807
[footsteps receding]

712
00:37:50,393 --> 00:37:51,436
[softly] Hello.

713
00:37:52,187 --> 00:37:53,646
Did someone change my color?

714
00:37:56,191 --> 00:37:58,318
3 MINUTES AGO

715
00:37:58,401 --> 00:37:59,402
Hello.

716
00:38:03,072 --> 00:38:05,366
I'll take Youn Sanghyun's red card

717
00:38:05,450 --> 00:38:08,620
and mix it with a blue card
to make it purple.

718
00:38:08,703 --> 00:38:12,540
I remembered I went to the Dealer Room
when my color was changed in Round 1.

719
00:38:13,082 --> 00:38:14,083
ROUND 1

720
00:38:14,167 --> 00:38:15,168
What? Changed the color?

721
00:38:15,251 --> 00:38:16,711
[dealer] Hello.

722
00:38:16,795 --> 00:38:18,588
My color's been changed to purple.

723
00:38:19,255 --> 00:38:22,634
I could use this rule
to force people who're hiding to come out.

724
00:38:22,717 --> 00:38:23,843
I started with Sanghyun

725
00:38:23,927 --> 00:38:26,346
and changed his color
even if I couldn't tag him.

726
00:38:26,930 --> 00:38:28,973
DAIL TEXTS SOMEONE

727
00:38:32,143 --> 00:38:33,144
YANG DAIL

728
00:38:33,228 --> 00:38:36,439
LET'S CHANGE THE COLORS
OF THE HIDERS TO FORCE THEM OUT

729
00:38:36,523 --> 00:38:39,108
I saw his text
and thought it was a great idea.

730
00:38:44,489 --> 00:38:47,867
I'll change Ddolddol's color to green.

731
00:38:51,371 --> 00:38:52,497
[Ddolddol whispers] Please.

732
00:38:53,456 --> 00:38:55,667
Oh, my. Someone changed my color.

733
00:38:55,750 --> 00:38:57,836
I went and it was changed to green.

734
00:38:59,546 --> 00:39:01,256
So what does that mean?

735
00:39:01,339 --> 00:39:03,883
I'm screwed. I should run away now.

736
00:39:03,967 --> 00:39:04,968
All right.

737
00:39:05,051 --> 00:39:09,806
DRAWN OUT BY DAIL'S STRATEGY:
DDOLDDOL AND SANGHYUN

738
00:39:09,889 --> 00:39:11,724
-Can I go this way?
-[dealer] Yes.

739
00:39:18,356 --> 00:39:20,859
[Ddolddol] I walked out,
and Horseking was standing right there.

740
00:39:20,942 --> 00:39:21,943
[chuckles]

741
00:39:22,026 --> 00:39:23,695
I was totally caught off guard.

742
00:39:23,778 --> 00:39:25,029
This is a battle of wits.

743
00:39:27,073 --> 00:39:28,074
HORSEKING TAGS DDOLDDOL

744
00:39:28,157 --> 00:39:29,909
[host] Tag confirmed.

745
00:39:29,993 --> 00:39:31,119
-Did you tag me?
-[Horseking] Yes.

746
00:39:31,202 --> 00:39:32,203
HORSEKING

747
00:39:32,287 --> 00:39:33,663
[laughs] How did you know?

748
00:39:34,664 --> 00:39:37,417
AT THE SAME TIME,
SANGHYUN LEAVES THE DEALER ROOM

749
00:39:41,045 --> 00:39:42,297
[Sanghyun] It's not me. What?

750
00:39:42,380 --> 00:39:43,631
[Joonsu] I tagged you.

751
00:39:43,715 --> 00:39:45,133
[host] Tag confirmed.

752
00:39:45,758 --> 00:39:49,429
I was coming out of the Dealer Room
and Joonsu suddenly tagged me.

753
00:39:49,512 --> 00:39:52,515
I was worried about what would happen,
and I got tagged.

754
00:39:52,599 --> 00:39:54,017
I'd been hiding the whole time.

755
00:39:54,100 --> 00:39:55,476
6 MINUTES BEFORE TAGGING

756
00:39:55,560 --> 00:39:56,936
But I was caught by Junseo.

757
00:40:00,565 --> 00:40:01,649
My goodness.

758
00:40:01,733 --> 00:40:03,234
[host] Tag confirmed.

759
00:40:06,112 --> 00:40:09,699
JOONSU CAME OUT AS A WHITE CARD

760
00:40:10,283 --> 00:40:12,076
[dealer] Another player used an item...

761
00:40:12,160 --> 00:40:14,537
[Joonsu] I heard a voice
in the Dealer Room.

762
00:40:14,621 --> 00:40:17,081
-[dealer] ...has been changed to purple.
-[Joonsu] I waited for him.

763
00:40:18,041 --> 00:40:21,294
WHITE CARD JOONSU
WAS WAITING FOR SANGHYUN

764
00:40:21,377 --> 00:40:22,378
[Sanghyun exhales heavily]

765
00:40:22,462 --> 00:40:23,755
YOUN SANGHYUN

766
00:40:23,838 --> 00:40:26,466
[Sanghyun] There wasn't much time left
until the game ended.

767
00:40:26,549 --> 00:40:29,844
After going to the Black and White Zone,
I needed to quickly tag people.

768
00:40:30,428 --> 00:40:31,429
JOONSU TAGGED SANGHYUN

769
00:40:31,512 --> 00:40:32,889
[Dail] Sanghyun was tagged.

770
00:40:33,556 --> 00:40:35,391
They got him. It says he was tagged.

771
00:40:35,975 --> 00:40:38,937
I wasn't the one who tagged him,
but I got a huge dopamine rush.

772
00:40:39,020 --> 00:40:40,521
I think it was a pretty good strategy.

773
00:40:40,605 --> 00:40:45,443
Dail is absolutely desperate to win.
He wants to win badly.

774
00:40:47,362 --> 00:40:48,488
[Dail] I'll find all of you.

775
00:40:49,364 --> 00:40:51,157
[sniffles] I'm sure someone's here.

776
00:40:51,240 --> 00:40:52,492
DAIL STARTS TAGGING MORE ACTIVELY

777
00:41:01,376 --> 00:41:02,377
There you are.

778
00:41:03,711 --> 00:41:04,712
There you are.

779
00:41:05,421 --> 00:41:06,756
Come out. Let's get this over with.

780
00:41:06,839 --> 00:41:07,840
DAIL CAN TAG ZZONE

781
00:41:07,924 --> 00:41:09,217
[ZZONE] Please let me go.

782
00:41:10,343 --> 00:41:11,761
Please let me go!

783
00:41:13,554 --> 00:41:14,806
Please let me go!

784
00:41:14,889 --> 00:41:15,890
[Dail] I got you.

785
00:41:16,516 --> 00:41:17,642
[host] Tag confirmed.

786
00:41:17,725 --> 00:41:18,726
DAIL TAGS ZZONE

787
00:41:18,810 --> 00:41:21,688
If I play this right,
I might be able to turn things around.

788
00:41:21,771 --> 00:41:24,232
I can do it.
I can catch them. I can survive.

789
00:41:24,315 --> 00:41:25,316
YANG DAIL

790
00:41:25,400 --> 00:41:27,402
[♪ powerful music playing]

791
00:41:29,654 --> 00:41:32,031
I just couldn't give up.

792
00:41:32,115 --> 00:41:34,951
If I get one more tag,
I might have a shot at winning.

793
00:41:36,285 --> 00:41:37,286
[Jaegyun exhales]

794
00:41:38,329 --> 00:41:39,956
[Dail] Right then, I ran into Jaegyun.

795
00:41:40,039 --> 00:41:41,082
-Jaegyun.
-Yeah?

796
00:41:41,165 --> 00:41:42,208
[Dail] What color are you?

797
00:41:43,459 --> 00:41:46,546
Then, I noticed Jaegyun
had a color I could tag.

798
00:41:47,296 --> 00:41:50,341
If I tag you, it counts. Can I tag you?

799
00:41:50,925 --> 00:41:53,052
[Jaegyun] I checked the score,
and I figured

800
00:41:53,136 --> 00:41:55,430
I couldn't win with my score.

801
00:41:55,513 --> 00:41:56,514
HWANG JAEGYUN

802
00:41:57,348 --> 00:41:58,391
Yeah, go ahead.

803
00:41:58,474 --> 00:42:00,935
I thought Dail worked so hard
and deserved to move up

804
00:42:01,019 --> 00:42:04,188
more than the people who had been hiding.

805
00:42:04,689 --> 00:42:06,482
-Thanks, man.
-[host] Tag confirmed.

806
00:42:06,566 --> 00:42:07,567
DAIL TAGS JAEGYUN

807
00:42:07,650 --> 00:42:08,776
My strategy was to fight.

808
00:42:08,860 --> 00:42:09,861
YANG DAIL

809
00:42:09,944 --> 00:42:11,070
It was that desperation

810
00:42:11,154 --> 00:42:14,032
and that competitive spirit
I hadn't felt in a while.

811
00:42:14,115 --> 00:42:16,367
Being persistent was my strategy.

812
00:42:16,451 --> 00:42:18,202
TIED FOR 1ST
SANGHYUN, DDOLDDOL, DAIL

813
00:42:18,286 --> 00:42:20,246
TIED FOR 4TH
JOONSU, HORSEKING, JUNSEO

814
00:42:20,329 --> 00:42:21,831
7TH: ZZONE
8TH: JAEGYUN

815
00:42:25,126 --> 00:42:27,295
KIM DDOLDDOL

816
00:42:28,004 --> 00:42:30,798
KIM DDOLDDOL HAS BECOME A WHITE CARD

817
00:42:33,259 --> 00:42:34,761
WHILE LEAVING BLACK AND WHITE ZONE

818
00:42:34,844 --> 00:42:35,928
[Ddolddol] Where are you going?

819
00:42:36,012 --> 00:42:37,472
-What?
-[host] Tag confirmed.

820
00:42:37,555 --> 00:42:38,556
KIM DDOLDDOL'S LUCKY DAY

821
00:42:38,639 --> 00:42:42,226
KIM DDOLDDOL GOES BACK INTO HIDING

822
00:42:55,782 --> 00:42:57,492
[Dail] I saw Ddolddol hiding.

823
00:42:57,575 --> 00:42:59,660
I was watching Ddolddol stand

824
00:42:59,744 --> 00:43:01,537
at the end of the pillar like this.

825
00:43:01,621 --> 00:43:03,456
I saw him from behind on the other side.

826
00:43:03,539 --> 00:43:04,665
I saw that...

827
00:43:07,293 --> 00:43:09,962
But he didn't have a color
I could tag anyway.

828
00:43:11,714 --> 00:43:13,174
I thought about what to do.

829
00:43:15,802 --> 00:43:17,845
HWANG JAEGYUN

830
00:43:25,353 --> 00:43:26,813
DAIL HAPPENS TO SPOT JAEGYUN

831
00:43:30,149 --> 00:43:32,110
[mouthing] Kim Ddolddol.

832
00:43:33,277 --> 00:43:35,113
Trust me. He's in that room.

833
00:43:35,196 --> 00:43:36,197
I told Jaegyun...

834
00:43:36,280 --> 00:43:39,700
[whispering]
"Hey! Ddolddol is in that room."

835
00:43:39,784 --> 00:43:41,828
[mouthing] He's at the end of the pillar.

836
00:43:41,911 --> 00:43:42,995
TATTLING WITH ALL HIS MIGHT

837
00:43:46,124 --> 00:43:47,625
[Jaegyun] Come here, Ddolddol.

838
00:43:47,708 --> 00:43:49,836
[Ddolddol] Oh, my goodness. I'm so fucked.

839
00:43:49,919 --> 00:43:51,129
Come here, Ddolddol.

840
00:44:01,139 --> 00:44:03,266
[Ddolddol] Since Jaegyun is a big guy,

841
00:44:03,349 --> 00:44:05,101
he couldn't squeeze
into that narrow space.

842
00:44:05,810 --> 00:44:07,979
JAEGYUN GOES AROUND TO THE OTHER SIDE

843
00:44:13,401 --> 00:44:15,736
MOVES TO THE OTHER ROOM AGAIN

844
00:44:18,990 --> 00:44:20,950
[Ddolddol panting]

845
00:44:31,127 --> 00:44:32,128
[tense silence]

846
00:44:34,547 --> 00:44:37,675
THE HALLWAY IS SUDDENLY QUIET

847
00:44:39,510 --> 00:44:41,512
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

848
00:44:48,769 --> 00:44:50,563
[Jaegyun] I'm going to get that punk.

849
00:45:00,114 --> 00:45:01,407
[panting]

850
00:45:01,991 --> 00:45:03,451
-Give it up.
-Please, spare me one time.

851
00:45:03,534 --> 00:45:04,619
-Let me tag you once.
-Not yet.

852
00:45:04,702 --> 00:45:05,703
[Jaegyun] I'm a White Card.

853
00:45:07,205 --> 00:45:08,289
[Ddolddol yelps] No!

854
00:45:08,372 --> 00:45:09,373
[exclaims]

855
00:45:09,957 --> 00:45:11,375
-[Jaegyun] Come here.
-[Ddolddol] Hold on.

856
00:45:11,459 --> 00:45:12,460
[Jaegyun] I got you.

857
00:45:12,543 --> 00:45:14,128
-[host] Tag confirmed.
-Five minutes haven't passed.

858
00:45:14,212 --> 00:45:15,213
JAEGYUN TAGS DDOLDDOL

859
00:45:15,296 --> 00:45:16,297
[exhales heavily]

860
00:45:16,380 --> 00:45:19,091
KIM DDOLDDOL

861
00:45:19,592 --> 00:45:21,594
[both panting, groaning]

862
00:45:22,678 --> 00:45:25,223
I thought
I was making the finals for sure.

863
00:45:25,306 --> 00:45:27,725
Finals, my foot. [scoffs]

864
00:45:27,808 --> 00:45:31,145
Apparently, Dail was the first one
to spot me.

865
00:45:31,229 --> 00:45:33,314
Gosh, he's so annoying.

866
00:45:33,397 --> 00:45:35,233
[Jaegyun sighs] I was afraid
I'd end as a White Card.

867
00:45:35,316 --> 00:45:36,984
-Did you get him?
-I did.

868
00:45:37,068 --> 00:45:38,069
[exhales]

869
00:45:39,320 --> 00:45:40,321
TIED FOR 1ST
KIM DDOLDDOL

870
00:45:40,404 --> 00:45:43,032
3RD
KIM DDOLDDOL

871
00:45:44,659 --> 00:45:47,495
YANG DAIL

872
00:45:48,496 --> 00:45:52,250
[Dail] Watching the time tick down
gave me a little hope.

873
00:45:52,333 --> 00:45:53,334
YOUN SANGHYUN

874
00:45:53,417 --> 00:45:57,546
Sanghyun and I were tied for first,
and since he was a White Card,

875
00:45:57,630 --> 00:46:01,092
I figured if I just stayed hidden,
I could actually win.

876
00:46:06,931 --> 00:46:09,100
So from then on, I decided to hide.

877
00:46:17,566 --> 00:46:21,821
I wanted them to feel
how hard it is to find someone.

878
00:46:24,490 --> 00:46:26,284
LEE JOONSU

879
00:46:26,367 --> 00:46:27,576
[Joonsu sighs] Whatever.

880
00:46:28,494 --> 00:46:30,162
I decided I needed to hide.

881
00:46:30,246 --> 00:46:32,623
Sanghyun was in first,
and he was a White Card.

882
00:46:32,707 --> 00:46:34,667
There wasn't much of a point difference.

883
00:46:34,750 --> 00:46:38,337
If I survive and get five points,
I thought I might get second place.

884
00:46:38,838 --> 00:46:42,550
JOONSU AND DAIL DECIDE TO HIDE

885
00:46:43,301 --> 00:46:44,969
SANGHYUN HASN'T TAGGED ANYONE YET

886
00:46:45,052 --> 00:46:47,847
[Sanghyun] I thought, "This is bad,"
because the game was about to end.

887
00:46:48,889 --> 00:46:50,474
I had to tag someone quickly.

888
00:46:53,602 --> 00:46:55,438
[♪ ominous music playing]

889
00:46:55,938 --> 00:46:59,025
IN THE BASEMENT WHERE DAIL HID EARLIER

890
00:47:11,871 --> 00:47:14,832
JUST A WALL BETWEEN THE TWO

891
00:47:31,932 --> 00:47:35,353
SANGHYUN FAILS TO FIND DAIL

892
00:47:40,649 --> 00:47:42,651
[Dail breathes deeply]

893
00:47:48,366 --> 00:47:49,617
[Sanghyun] It was driving me crazy.

894
00:47:49,700 --> 00:47:51,494
[♪ intense music playing]

895
00:47:57,208 --> 00:48:00,878
SANGHYUN APPROACHES ROOM
WHERE JOONSU IS HIDING

896
00:48:00,961 --> 00:48:02,963
[sniffing]

897
00:48:06,342 --> 00:48:09,970
DEALER ROOM 1

898
00:48:10,054 --> 00:48:12,390
[Joonsu] I could hear
Sanghyun coming near me.

899
00:48:13,849 --> 00:48:15,768
[whispers] Please don't come this way.

900
00:48:16,602 --> 00:48:18,521
[Sanghyun] I was looking everywhere,
and then...

901
00:48:19,939 --> 00:48:21,607
I remembered the hiding spots I would use.

902
00:48:21,690 --> 00:48:23,359
It's how I hid during Round 2.

903
00:48:23,943 --> 00:48:26,654
SANGHYUN WAS HIDING BEHIND THE DOOR

904
00:48:26,737 --> 00:48:30,282
That suddenly hit me, so I ran right over.

905
00:48:32,993 --> 00:48:35,079
[♪ dramatic music playing]

906
00:48:37,289 --> 00:48:38,416
[Joonsu in English] Fuck!

907
00:48:39,667 --> 00:48:41,585
[host in Korean] The game is now over.

908
00:48:44,004 --> 00:48:46,549
We will announce
the results of the Main Match.

909
00:48:47,550 --> 00:48:50,928
The players
with the two highest final scores

910
00:48:51,011 --> 00:48:52,388
will advance to the finals.

911
00:48:52,972 --> 00:48:55,015
The player with the highest score is...

912
00:48:57,476 --> 00:49:00,146
[Dail] If I played this right,
I could secure a spot.

913
00:49:00,229 --> 00:49:02,773
[Sanghyun] Maybe I even have
a shot at first place.

914
00:49:07,361 --> 00:49:09,280
[host] ...Yang Dail.

915
00:49:09,363 --> 00:49:11,365
[players exclaim, applaud]

916
00:49:11,449 --> 00:49:13,951
[Dail] I'm the first one
to make it to the finals?

917
00:49:14,034 --> 00:49:16,245
That gave me another huge dopamine rush.

918
00:49:16,871 --> 00:49:18,539
[Sanghyun] I was kind of stunned.

919
00:49:19,707 --> 00:49:20,833
RIGHT BEFORE END OF ROUND 2

920
00:49:20,916 --> 00:49:22,793
It was in a tucked-away corner.

921
00:49:22,877 --> 00:49:25,796
I could clearly see Joonsu
through the crack of the door.

922
00:49:26,881 --> 00:49:28,466
I was about to tag him.

923
00:49:28,549 --> 00:49:29,800
-[buzzer goes off]
-[Joonsu whoops]

924
00:49:29,884 --> 00:49:31,260
SANGHYUN'S COMEBACK FAILS

925
00:49:31,844 --> 00:49:35,055
[Sanghyun] The round ended right then,
so I missed him by a hair.

926
00:49:35,139 --> 00:49:37,099
LEE JOONSU

927
00:49:37,183 --> 00:49:39,477
[Joonsu whooping triumphantly]

928
00:49:39,560 --> 00:49:41,604
That big boy screamed really loud.

929
00:49:41,687 --> 00:49:42,688
[sighs in annoyance]

930
00:49:43,939 --> 00:49:46,525
[Dail] Of course,
hiding is a good strategy.

931
00:49:46,609 --> 00:49:50,738
But ultimately, whoever gets the most tags
is going to win this game.

932
00:49:50,821 --> 00:49:54,408
The cowards hiding in closets
could only get the five points

933
00:49:54,492 --> 00:49:57,745
they got each round.

934
00:49:57,828 --> 00:50:01,123
But I kept creating
more opportunities aggressively.

935
00:50:01,207 --> 00:50:03,626
I think that opened up
more chances for me.

936
00:50:05,628 --> 00:50:08,672
[Ddolddol] First place went to Dail.
I never saw that coming.

937
00:50:08,756 --> 00:50:10,424
Yang Dail really pulled this off?

938
00:50:10,508 --> 00:50:13,844
I didn't think he could do it,
but Dail pulled it off.

939
00:50:13,928 --> 00:50:15,596
He made a comeback in an instant.

940
00:50:15,679 --> 00:50:17,973
I think Dail was the best player.

941
00:50:18,057 --> 00:50:20,976
1ST
YANG DAIL

942
00:50:21,602 --> 00:50:23,646
[host] Due to a tie for second place,

943
00:50:23,729 --> 00:50:26,941
the player with the most total tags
will advance.

944
00:50:27,024 --> 00:50:30,361
However, tags made as a White Card

945
00:50:30,444 --> 00:50:32,238
do not count towards the total.

946
00:50:32,821 --> 00:50:35,074
[Joonsu] I felt nervous. Could it be me?

947
00:50:35,157 --> 00:50:37,284
[Sanghyun] I couldn't predict anything.

948
00:50:37,368 --> 00:50:39,703
I didn't have time
to keep track of others' scores.

949
00:50:40,454 --> 00:50:43,624
[host] In second place,
the player with the most tags is...

950
00:50:46,168 --> 00:50:47,753
Youn Sanghyun.

951
00:50:48,254 --> 00:50:49,255
[players laughing]

952
00:50:49,338 --> 00:50:51,715
2ND PLACE
YOUN SANGHYUN

953
00:50:51,799 --> 00:50:54,176
Sanghyun, you have
to be desperate like me.

954
00:50:54,843 --> 00:50:55,844
[exhales]

955
00:50:55,928 --> 00:50:59,139
[Joonsu] I'm supposed to congratulate him,
but I couldn't. I was so bummed.

956
00:50:59,765 --> 00:51:03,477
0 TAGS
JOONSU TAGGED ONLY AS A WHITE CARD

957
00:51:03,561 --> 00:51:08,524
It's really hard to tag someone
when you're not a White Card.

958
00:51:08,607 --> 00:51:11,694
I was happy to be among the top players
and to finish in second place.

959
00:51:11,777 --> 00:51:14,446
I guess I'm going to the finals.

960
00:51:15,698 --> 00:51:17,866
Yang Dail's actually going to the finals?

961
00:51:17,950 --> 00:51:20,202
And he beat these strong players?

962
00:51:20,286 --> 00:51:25,165
1ST PLACE: YANG DAIL
2ND PLACE: YOUN SANGHYUN

963
00:51:25,958 --> 00:51:29,169
[host] We will now begin
the final Seeker Vote.

964
00:51:29,253 --> 00:51:30,754
[♪ tense music playing]

965
00:51:30,838 --> 00:51:31,839
[sighs heavily]

966
00:51:33,173 --> 00:51:34,925
The results of the vote will determine

967
00:51:35,009 --> 00:51:38,470
whether Youn Sanghyun
advances to the finals or not.

968
00:51:38,554 --> 00:51:39,930
-Sorry?
-[Horseking] What?

969
00:51:40,556 --> 00:51:41,724
Oh, Jimin!

970
00:51:41,807 --> 00:51:43,392
Oh, my gosh!

971
00:51:43,475 --> 00:51:47,354
[host] Prison player Park Jimin
can also vote.

972
00:51:47,438 --> 00:51:49,273
-[ZZONE] Jimin!
-[Ddolddol] You're back.

973
00:51:49,356 --> 00:51:50,524
It's good to see you.

974
00:51:50,608 --> 00:51:51,984
It's so good to see you.

975
00:51:53,819 --> 00:51:56,572
[host] Before the Seeker Vote,
we have an announcement.

976
00:51:57,740 --> 00:52:00,909
In today's Main Match, the Seeker...

977
00:52:03,162 --> 00:52:04,371
completed their mission.

978
00:52:06,790 --> 00:52:07,833
[players exclaim]

979
00:52:07,916 --> 00:52:08,959
How did they do that?

980
00:52:09,043 --> 00:52:13,422
[host] By completing their mission,
the Seeker will gain a special benefit.

981
00:52:14,632 --> 00:52:16,759
[Junseo] What was the mission?
I have no idea.

982
00:52:16,842 --> 00:52:19,595
I remember everyone was just hiding
and doing nothing.

983
00:52:20,888 --> 00:52:22,973
[Sanghyun] I guess
the Seeker completed their mission.

984
00:52:23,057 --> 00:52:24,391
-What's the benefit?
-[ZZONE] An extra vote?

985
00:52:24,475 --> 00:52:25,476
It has to be an extra vote.

986
00:52:25,559 --> 00:52:26,685
We just need to vote well.

987
00:52:26,769 --> 00:52:29,938
[host] If the Seeker is not a player
in first or second place,

988
00:52:31,357 --> 00:52:33,692
and is not caught,

989
00:52:33,776 --> 00:52:36,195
Youn Sanghyun will go to the Death Match.

990
00:52:36,779 --> 00:52:37,780
[players gasp]

991
00:52:37,863 --> 00:52:39,948
2ND PLACE SANGHYUN SENT TO DEATH MATCH
IF SEEKER GOES FREE

992
00:52:40,032 --> 00:52:41,325
[Horseking] Hurry up and figure it out!

993
00:52:41,408 --> 00:52:43,369
[Jaegyun] Sanghyun,
you have to catch the Seeker.

994
00:52:43,452 --> 00:52:45,120
[Horseking] We have to trust you.

995
00:52:45,663 --> 00:52:46,705
[Sanghyun] If the Seeker isn't caught,

996
00:52:46,789 --> 00:52:49,291
second place is out
and the Seeker advances.

997
00:52:50,459 --> 00:52:52,127
But I'm in second place.

998
00:52:53,003 --> 00:52:56,465
If I knew, I would've been more aggressive
in aiming for first place.

999
00:52:57,091 --> 00:53:00,302
We had to catch the Seeker
in a single day.

1000
00:53:00,386 --> 00:53:02,388
I knew it wasn't going to be easy.

1001
00:53:02,471 --> 00:53:04,807
The Seeker is a genuine spy.

1002
00:53:04,890 --> 00:53:07,976
It must be nice. Being the Seeker
is such a hell of a good deal.

1003
00:53:08,477 --> 00:53:11,689
It felt like the Seeker swooped in
to snatch it all away at the end.

1004
00:53:11,772 --> 00:53:15,984
I was angry, so imagine
how angry Sanghyun must've been.

1005
00:53:16,568 --> 00:53:18,404
What a sweet deal
the Seeker's got this round.

1006
00:53:18,487 --> 00:53:21,073
I guess only two people
will advance from this game.

1007
00:53:21,156 --> 00:53:22,950
-Then, I've made it.
-[ZZONE] That's right.

1008
00:53:23,033 --> 00:53:25,369
-[Horseking] Yeah, you made it.
-Yang Dail's safe.

1009
00:53:26,286 --> 00:53:28,288
[Dail] I was really relieved.

1010
00:53:28,372 --> 00:53:30,499
But at the same time, I felt bad.

1011
00:53:31,417 --> 00:53:34,837
[host] The eight players, excluding
Park Jimin, are the Seeker candidates.

1012
00:53:36,672 --> 00:53:38,841
Voting will close in an hour.

1013
00:53:40,592 --> 00:53:41,802
[Ddolddol] Jimin, you can vote, right?

1014
00:53:41,885 --> 00:53:43,387
-[ZZONE] Yes.
-[Jimin] I'm here to vote.

1015
00:53:44,430 --> 00:53:46,098
I don't think this game is favorable

1016
00:53:46,181 --> 00:53:47,224
-to the Seeker.
-It is.

1017
00:53:47,307 --> 00:53:48,934
-[Horseking] You think so?
-Yeah, very much so.

1018
00:53:49,852 --> 00:53:51,270
I'm not so sure.

1019
00:53:54,523 --> 00:53:57,609
If we fail to catch the Seeker,
the Seeker advances to the finals.

1020
00:53:57,693 --> 00:54:00,362
Sanghyun, you have to find them
as if your life depends on it.

1021
00:54:00,446 --> 00:54:03,198
-[Horseking] You have to find them now.
-Sanghyun, you have to do it.

1022
00:54:03,282 --> 00:54:05,033
Is there anyone that comes to mind?

1023
00:54:05,117 --> 00:54:07,369
-Well, I do have some candidates.
-Tell us.

1024
00:54:07,870 --> 00:54:09,371
Just in front of everyone?

1025
00:54:09,455 --> 00:54:13,876
You can ask who you think it is
to leave for a moment to persuade us.

1026
00:54:13,959 --> 00:54:16,879
I don't think you can talk about this
with everyone around.

1027
00:54:18,964 --> 00:54:20,048
-Should I say it?
-Go ahead.

1028
00:54:20,132 --> 00:54:21,258
-Yeah.
-Well...

1029
00:54:21,884 --> 00:54:24,511
I'm a bit suspicious
of Jaegyun and Ddolddol.

1030
00:54:27,723 --> 00:54:28,724
Me?

1031
00:54:29,349 --> 00:54:32,394
Then, could you two give us a moment?
We'll have a quick talk.

1032
00:54:33,103 --> 00:54:34,104
Sure.

1033
00:54:35,189 --> 00:54:37,608
-[Dail] We'll talk in private.
-[Jaegyun] Okay. [sighs]

1034
00:54:38,692 --> 00:54:40,611
-I feel like Jimin and ZZONE.
-I worked my ass off.

1035
00:54:40,694 --> 00:54:41,695
[Jaegyun] I know.

1036
00:54:41,779 --> 00:54:44,990
I just did my best in the game.
Why would he pick me?

1037
00:54:45,574 --> 00:54:47,284
What is he suspicious about?

1038
00:54:47,367 --> 00:54:50,871
I mean, I played by the book.
What's the problem?

1039
00:54:57,461 --> 00:54:59,046
THE TWO PLAYERS UNDER SUSPICION

1040
00:54:59,129 --> 00:55:00,506
I can't believe this.

1041
00:55:00,589 --> 00:55:02,382
-I worked my ass off.
-Me too.

1042
00:55:02,925 --> 00:55:04,426
I worked so hard to survive.

1043
00:55:04,510 --> 00:55:05,511
I know.

1044
00:55:06,512 --> 00:55:07,513
Who do you think it is?

1045
00:55:07,596 --> 00:55:08,639
-What?
-Who do you think it is?

1046
00:55:08,722 --> 00:55:10,724
To be honest, I suspected you.

1047
00:55:10,807 --> 00:55:12,809
[♪ unsettling music playing]

1048
00:55:12,893 --> 00:55:15,562
But in my opinion, just going off my gut,

1049
00:55:16,063 --> 00:55:17,231
I think it's Horseking.

1050
00:55:17,314 --> 00:55:18,732
-It's just my hunch.
-Horseking? Why?

1051
00:55:18,815 --> 00:55:20,484
[Ddolddol] He changed my color to green.

1052
00:55:20,567 --> 00:55:24,071
I'll change Ddolddol's color to green.

1053
00:55:25,030 --> 00:55:26,615
[host] Tag confirmed.

1054
00:55:26,698 --> 00:55:29,117
And when I ran into him here,

1055
00:55:29,201 --> 00:55:31,203
-he was slowly walking down the stairs.
-[Jaegyun] Yeah.

1056
00:55:31,787 --> 00:55:33,497
[host] Tag confirmed.

1057
00:55:33,580 --> 00:55:35,499
HORSEKING WAS TAGGED VERY EASILY

1058
00:55:35,582 --> 00:55:37,125
[Ddolddol] "What? Tag."

1059
00:55:37,209 --> 00:55:38,794
I did that, and he did nothing.

1060
00:55:38,877 --> 00:55:42,965
I think it's Horseking.
It's just my gut feeling.

1061
00:55:48,762 --> 00:55:51,098
[dealer] We will now begin
the Seeker card draw.

1062
00:55:51,181 --> 00:55:53,225
Please choose a card and flip it over.

1063
00:55:53,767 --> 00:55:55,769
[♪ eerie music playing]

1064
00:55:58,564 --> 00:55:59,856
No way it'll be me.

1065
00:56:07,030 --> 00:56:09,199
[dealer] The card
Kim Ddolddol has drawn is...

1066
00:56:11,451 --> 00:56:12,995
The card Horseking has drawn is...

1067
00:56:14,079 --> 00:56:15,998
The card Hwang Jaegyun has drawn is...

1068
00:56:17,291 --> 00:56:18,458
The Seeker card.

1069
00:56:20,294 --> 00:56:23,005
[host] You have become the Seeker.

1070
00:56:23,088 --> 00:56:27,009
ONE OF THEM IS THE SEEKER

1071
00:56:28,260 --> 00:56:31,638
I originally thought it was Jaegyun.

1072
00:56:32,764 --> 00:56:34,516
When we did
the Seeker card draw the day before,

1073
00:56:34,641 --> 00:56:36,810
I was convinced it had to be Jaegyun.

1074
00:56:37,394 --> 00:56:41,523
His whole demeanor changed so much
that I started suspecting him at first.

1075
00:56:41,607 --> 00:56:44,401
But during the game,
I noticed a lot of suspicious things

1076
00:56:44,484 --> 00:56:46,194
about Ddolddol,

1077
00:56:46,778 --> 00:56:48,530
so I brought it up with the others.

1078
00:56:48,614 --> 00:56:50,490
I'm pretty sure it's Ddolddol.

1079
00:56:50,574 --> 00:56:52,367
-[Jimin] Why?
-The day before,

1080
00:56:52,451 --> 00:56:54,202
Junseo, him, and I formed an alliance.

1081
00:56:54,286 --> 00:56:56,580
Ddolddol said if us three teamed up,
we could win.

1082
00:56:56,663 --> 00:56:58,874
-I talked to Junseo earlier.
-Yeah?

1083
00:56:59,374 --> 00:57:01,043
How about the three of us work together?

1084
00:57:01,752 --> 00:57:03,420
-[Sanghyun] As a team?
-Yeah, what do you think?

1085
00:57:03,503 --> 00:57:05,047
DDOLDDOL SUGGESTED
THE ALLIANCE FIRST

1086
00:57:05,130 --> 00:57:06,840
But only two people make it to the finals.

1087
00:57:06,923 --> 00:57:09,217
[Ddolddol] Two of us would advance.
One would be left out.

1088
00:57:09,718 --> 00:57:12,638
Ddolddol's been plotting again.

1089
00:57:12,721 --> 00:57:16,391
One thing that seemed strange today
was when everyone was hiding.

1090
00:57:16,475 --> 00:57:17,726
"What should I change yours to?"

1091
00:57:17,809 --> 00:57:19,686
"What color do you want?" He said that.

1092
00:57:19,770 --> 00:57:23,607
"What color do you want?
Which colors do you want to mix?"

1093
00:57:23,690 --> 00:57:26,151
There was no reason to mix colors.

1094
00:57:26,234 --> 00:57:28,570
-We could just stay hidden.
-And I couldn't tag anyone.

1095
00:57:28,654 --> 00:57:31,490
I think the mission was
to find out where the cards were

1096
00:57:31,573 --> 00:57:33,617
and go around changing people's colors.

1097
00:57:33,700 --> 00:57:36,203
If they can't find cards,
they can't do the mission.

1098
00:57:36,286 --> 00:57:38,664
The hidden item was the safe.

1099
00:57:38,747 --> 00:57:40,540
And Ddolddol found it first.

1100
00:57:41,041 --> 00:57:44,211
You know the bathroom all the way
in the corner of the third floor?

1101
00:57:44,294 --> 00:57:46,213
-The safe was in that room.
-[Horseking] Really?

1102
00:57:46,296 --> 00:57:49,341
[Sanghyun] Yeah, he went straight
to that room and figured out the answer.

1103
00:57:52,010 --> 00:57:53,762
He used the Black Card early on.

1104
00:57:53,845 --> 00:57:55,430
[ZZONE] Right, during Round 1.

1105
00:57:55,514 --> 00:57:56,515
Who did?

1106
00:57:56,598 --> 00:57:59,101
-Ddolddol used the Black Card early on.
-The Black Card.

1107
00:57:59,184 --> 00:58:00,352
It was a totally hidden item.

1108
00:58:00,435 --> 00:58:04,398
You've submitted the Black Card.
It is now activated for use.

1109
00:58:04,481 --> 00:58:05,941
[ZZONE] I think the mission
was changing cards.

1110
00:58:06,024 --> 00:58:07,609
Yes, I do think it's Ddolddol.

1111
00:58:07,693 --> 00:58:10,904
Sanghyun made an alliance with you,
so why is he doubting you?

1112
00:58:10,987 --> 00:58:14,825
[Ddolddol] Because he thinks
I changed the card colors?

1113
00:58:14,908 --> 00:58:15,909
That might be why.

1114
00:58:15,992 --> 00:58:19,121
-I didn't change anyone else's color.
-[Ddolddol] Or he might be bluffing.

1115
00:58:19,204 --> 00:58:21,415
Maybe because I found and used
the Black Card early?

1116
00:58:21,498 --> 00:58:22,708
Maybe that's why...

1117
00:58:22,791 --> 00:58:24,292
But I used the Black Card too.

1118
00:58:25,669 --> 00:58:26,920
I'll use the Black Card.

1119
00:58:27,003 --> 00:58:28,004
ROUND 2

1120
00:58:28,088 --> 00:58:29,756
HWANG JAEGYUN USED THE BLACK CARD

1121
00:58:29,840 --> 00:58:31,258
Where is everyone?

1122
00:58:36,638 --> 00:58:38,306
Where are they all hiding?

1123
00:58:38,890 --> 00:58:39,975
I'm here to return it.

1124
00:58:40,058 --> 00:58:42,352
NEVER GOT TO TAG WITH THE BLACK CARD

1125
00:58:42,436 --> 00:58:44,688
Are they suspecting us
since we got the Black Cards?

1126
00:58:44,771 --> 00:58:46,106
-[Ddolddol] That might be it, or...
-But...

1127
00:58:46,189 --> 00:58:49,359
I was so focused on searching.
I guess that's why they got suspicious.

1128
00:58:49,860 --> 00:58:52,863
Horseking and I agreed
to use the Black Card together.

1129
00:58:52,946 --> 00:58:54,448
[Ddolddol] I think it's Horseking.

1130
00:58:54,531 --> 00:58:55,532
[door opens]

1131
00:58:56,533 --> 00:58:58,034
-Could you two please come in?
-Sure.

1132
00:58:58,118 --> 00:59:00,662
-They want to hear your final statements.
-[Jaegyun] Sure.

1133
00:59:01,246 --> 00:59:05,250
[Horseking] Let's each name someone
we suspect and hear what they have to say.

1134
00:59:05,876 --> 00:59:08,628
If you're not the Seeker,
you can really make your case.

1135
00:59:08,712 --> 00:59:10,714
-[Ddolddol] But you don't need to.
-We don't have to.

1136
00:59:10,797 --> 00:59:14,050
It doesn't really change anything for us
if we're not the Seeker.

1137
00:59:14,134 --> 00:59:16,595
Ddolddol and I are going
to the Death Match anyway.

1138
00:59:17,471 --> 00:59:18,722
[Sanghyun] Wait a minute.

1139
00:59:19,723 --> 00:59:21,308
We're all in the Death Match anyway.

1140
00:59:21,391 --> 00:59:23,059
Only difference is who we'll go with.

1141
00:59:23,143 --> 00:59:24,895
-What does that mean? Is that right?
-Yes.

1142
00:59:25,020 --> 00:59:26,021
It's either the Seeker

1143
00:59:26,104 --> 00:59:27,147
-or me in the Death Match.
-[Jimin] Yes.

1144
00:59:27,230 --> 00:59:28,482
-That's how it works.
-[ZZONE] Yes.

1145
00:59:28,565 --> 00:59:31,359
If the Seeker convinces us
to vote for someone else,

1146
00:59:31,443 --> 00:59:33,695
the Seeker can advance instead.

1147
00:59:33,779 --> 00:59:35,238
So, both of them are saying

1148
00:59:35,322 --> 00:59:37,324
-they're not the Seeker.
-[ZZONE] They're not the Seeker.

1149
00:59:37,407 --> 00:59:40,327
It's up to us? Okay.
Then we can skip their statements.

1150
00:59:40,410 --> 00:59:41,453
[Sanghyun] All right, then.

1151
00:59:41,995 --> 00:59:44,247
For what? We're going
to the Death Match anyway.

1152
00:59:49,669 --> 00:59:52,380
Let's hear the reasons
for why the each of us are suspected.

1153
00:59:52,464 --> 00:59:53,590
To be honest,

1154
00:59:53,673 --> 00:59:55,550
-I think it's Ddolddol.
-[Ddolddol] I see.

1155
00:59:55,634 --> 00:59:59,721
You'd always been aggressive
about finding the Seeker.

1156
00:59:59,805 --> 01:00:02,516
But since yesterday, you've backed off.
That's the only reason.

1157
01:00:02,599 --> 01:00:04,643
-You've changed.
-[ZZONE] I also think it's Ddolddol.

1158
01:00:04,726 --> 01:00:07,187
There was no reason
to take risks in Round 2,

1159
01:00:07,354 --> 01:00:09,314
but you kept visiting the Dealer Room.

1160
01:00:09,397 --> 01:00:12,359
There's really only one reason
why I suspected Ddolddol.

1161
01:00:12,442 --> 01:00:14,194
You told me something
after "Cops and Robbers."

1162
01:00:14,319 --> 01:00:16,154
-When you denied being a Good Citizen...
-Yeah?

1163
01:00:16,238 --> 01:00:20,367
...you said it was hard for you to lie
in front of someone like me.

1164
01:00:20,450 --> 01:00:23,078
Honestly, it's extremely hard for me
to lie to someone like him.

1165
01:00:23,161 --> 01:00:25,539
You looked me in the eye
and asked directly.

1166
01:00:25,622 --> 01:00:27,374
You're very direct.

1167
01:00:27,457 --> 01:00:30,252
-Ah, so you feel intimidated.
-Yes.

1168
01:00:30,335 --> 01:00:31,920
I felt like Dail had known it was me.

1169
01:00:32,003 --> 01:00:35,215
[Dail] You said it was hard for you
to lie to someone like me.

1170
01:00:35,298 --> 01:00:40,095
And I noticed that you avoided
eye contact with me and didn't talk to me.

1171
01:00:40,178 --> 01:00:41,471
That's what I thought.

1172
01:00:43,849 --> 01:00:45,350
That's the only reason.

1173
01:00:48,019 --> 01:00:49,980
[Ddolddol] As soon as Jaegyun and I
came back in,

1174
01:00:50,063 --> 01:00:51,982
everyone started turning on me.

1175
01:00:52,065 --> 01:00:55,318
It was pretty annoying.
Is this what male friendship is like?

1176
01:00:55,402 --> 01:00:57,487
This is loyalty among men? What the heck?

1177
01:00:58,238 --> 01:01:00,365
-[Dail] Shall we vote then?
-Go cast your votes.

1178
01:01:03,618 --> 01:01:09,207
PLAYERS COME ONE BY ONE TO VOTE

1179
01:01:11,835 --> 01:01:14,462
[dealer] Please vote for who you suspect
is the Seeker.

1180
01:01:17,132 --> 01:01:18,675
I'll go with the majority.

1181
01:01:18,758 --> 01:01:19,759
[Dail] I'm really sorry, Ddolddol.

1182
01:01:19,843 --> 01:01:20,844
SEEKER VOTE
KIM DDOLDDOL

1183
01:01:20,927 --> 01:01:22,762
[ZZONE] I've suspected Ddolddol
since day one.

1184
01:01:22,846 --> 01:01:24,055
SEEKER VOTE
KIM DDOLDDOL

1185
01:01:31,521 --> 01:01:33,982
[dealer] Please vote for who you suspect
is the Seeker.

1186
01:01:34,900 --> 01:01:36,109
[sighs, clicks tongue]

1187
01:01:36,192 --> 01:01:37,903
Our dear Sanghyun.

1188
01:01:39,821 --> 01:01:41,281
DDOLDDOL VOTED FOR HORSEKING

1189
01:01:41,364 --> 01:01:42,908
This has been fun to the very end.

1190
01:01:45,160 --> 01:01:47,162
[♪ tense music playing]

1191
01:01:55,378 --> 01:01:57,130
Why am I in second place again?

1192
01:02:01,301 --> 01:02:04,554
The others said they suspected
Ddolddol was the Seeker.

1193
01:02:05,055 --> 01:02:08,391
The evidence all pointed to him,
and my gut said the same thing.

1194
01:02:08,934 --> 01:02:10,560
It has to be Ddolddol.

1195
01:02:12,771 --> 01:02:16,399
SANGHYUN VOTED FOR DDOLDDOL

1196
01:02:20,070 --> 01:02:21,947
[host] Voting has ended.

1197
01:02:22,530 --> 01:02:23,949
[mic feedback]

1198
01:02:24,699 --> 01:02:26,993
We will reveal the results
of the Seeker Vote.

1199
01:02:27,994 --> 01:02:32,749
The player who received
the most votes is...

1200
01:02:34,334 --> 01:02:35,877
Kim Ddolddol.

1201
01:02:36,878 --> 01:02:40,674
[chuckles] It's getting pretty annoying
to be named twice.

1202
01:02:41,174 --> 01:02:43,551
I've survived the Death Match twice.

1203
01:02:43,635 --> 01:02:47,555
I've also received the most votes
in the Seeker Vote twice.

1204
01:02:47,639 --> 01:02:49,057
I wasn't exactly thrilled.

1205
01:02:50,684 --> 01:02:52,560
[host] Based on the final
Seeker Vote results...

1206
01:02:53,728 --> 01:02:57,565
[Sanghyun] Ddolddol has to be the Seeker
so that I can make it to the finals.

1207
01:03:00,110 --> 01:03:02,237
[Horseking laughing]
He must be so nervous.

1208
01:03:02,737 --> 01:03:03,822
[Jimin] You never know.
We might catch them.

1209
01:03:03,905 --> 01:03:04,990
[ZZONE] Right.

1210
01:03:05,073 --> 01:03:07,784
[Ddolddol] I had this weird mix
of feelings at the time.

1211
01:03:08,493 --> 01:03:10,245
[host] Your attempt to catch the Seeker...

1212
01:03:11,579 --> 01:03:13,540
[Jimin] Just wait until I catch you.

1213
01:03:13,623 --> 01:03:15,542
[Junseo] I really wanted
to get the Seeker.

1214
01:03:15,625 --> 01:03:18,211
[Jaegyun] I didn't expect it at all.

1215
01:03:18,294 --> 01:03:22,298
[Sanghyun] We have to catch the Seeker.
Please say he's the Seeker.

1216
01:03:23,258 --> 01:03:24,926
[host] ...has failed.

1217
01:03:25,010 --> 01:03:27,679
[♪ thrilling music playing]

1218
01:03:27,762 --> 01:03:29,889
[Sanghyun]
What? Then, who's the Seeker?

1219
01:03:31,433 --> 01:03:33,143
You dug your own grave, Sanghyun.

1220
01:03:34,144 --> 01:03:35,353
Well done.

1221
01:03:38,314 --> 01:03:40,608
Gosh, I was so sure it was Ddolddol.

1222
01:03:40,692 --> 01:03:42,902
[Dail] Every prediction I make
turns out to be wrong.

1223
01:03:42,986 --> 01:03:45,947
[host] We will now reveal
the identity of the Seeker.

1224
01:03:46,031 --> 01:03:47,407
[exclaims excitedly]

1225
01:03:47,907 --> 01:03:50,285
Advancing to the finals
as the Seeker is...

1226
01:03:50,952 --> 01:03:52,370
[Jimin] Gosh, who could it be?

1227
01:03:52,454 --> 01:03:53,496
[Joonsu] I want to know.

1228
01:03:53,580 --> 01:03:54,622
[Jaegyun] Who could be the Seeker?

1229
01:03:55,123 --> 01:03:57,667
[ZZONE] I kept thinking
who the Seeker could be.

1230
01:03:58,460 --> 01:03:59,919
[♪ music intensifies]

1231
01:04:01,963 --> 01:04:06,217
[host] We will now begin
the final Death Match of Deadly Tag.

1232
01:04:06,301 --> 01:04:07,886
[Junseo] I'll see this through to the end.

1233
01:04:07,969 --> 01:04:09,763
[ZZONE] I'll prove myself
and advance to the finals.

1234
01:04:09,971 --> 01:04:12,307
[Jaegyun] It seems
she was sharpening her claws in prison.

1235
01:04:12,390 --> 01:04:15,185
[Jimin] They sent me to jail.
These bastards are all dead.

1236
01:04:15,268 --> 01:04:17,729
Give me one Wrench and one Shield, please.

1237
01:04:17,812 --> 01:04:21,232
[dealer] Here are the battle results.
The winner is Park Jimin.

1238
01:04:21,733 --> 01:04:22,942
It's so frustrating and annoying.

1239
01:04:23,026 --> 01:04:24,694
She ruined everything for me.

1240
01:04:24,778 --> 01:04:26,029
[dealer] Park Jimin wins.

1241
01:04:26,112 --> 01:04:27,363
[Junseo] Why did I lose?

1242
01:04:27,447 --> 01:04:29,866
What a fucking idiot.

1243
01:04:29,949 --> 01:04:31,493
[Ddolddol] So much for making the finals.

1244
01:04:31,576 --> 01:04:33,328
[Sanghyun] From then on,
I thought it was over.

1245
01:04:33,411 --> 01:04:35,246
[ZZONE] I should've tried
everything I could.

1246
01:04:35,330 --> 01:04:36,790
[Jaegyun] Is this how
I'm getting eliminated?

1247
01:04:37,373 --> 01:04:38,583
[Horseking] This is so frustrating.

1248
01:04:38,666 --> 01:04:41,795
[host] The last player to advance
to the finals of Deadly Tag is...

1249
01:04:41,878 --> 01:04:43,505
[Junseo sniffles]

1250
01:04:43,588 --> 01:04:45,173
For fuck's sake.

1251
01:04:45,882 --> 01:04:49,219
[host] The final game is "Tag."

1252
01:04:49,302 --> 01:04:50,428
[Dail] Where did he go?

1253
01:04:50,512 --> 01:04:53,223
Is there anything
more grueling than this game?

1254
01:04:53,306 --> 01:04:55,558
-Please let me go!
-That bastard!

1255
01:04:56,559 --> 01:04:57,685
[groans]

1256
01:04:59,020 --> 01:05:00,396
[sobbing]

1257
01:05:00,480 --> 01:05:02,982
[host] The winner of Deadly Tag is...

1258
01:05:04,776 --> 01:05:06,778
[♪ ominous music playing]

1259
01:05:25,004 --> 01:05:27,006
Translated by Youji Kim
